msgid "whack!"
msgstr "꽝!"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
msgid "mounted upgraded solar panel"
msgstr "장착된 개량형 태양 전지판"

#. ~ Description for mounted upgraded solar panel
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
msgid "A mounted upgraded solar panel connected to building's electric grid."
msgstr "건물의 전력망에 연결된 개량형 태양 전지판."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
msgid "mounted battery"
msgstr "탑재된 배터리"

#. ~ Description for mounted battery
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
msgid "A battery mount connected to building's electric grid."
msgstr "건물의 전력망에 연결된 탑재된 배터리."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
msgid "mounted storage battery"
msgstr "탑재된 축전지"

#. ~ Description for mounted storage battery
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
msgid ""
"A storage battery mount salvaged from a vehicle, and connected to building's"
" electric grid."
msgstr "차량에서 떼어낸 축전지로, 건물 전력망에 연결되어 있습니다."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
msgid "mounted large storage battery"
msgstr "탑재된 초대형 축전지"

#. ~ Description for mounted large storage battery
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
msgid ""
"A huge storage battery mount salvaged from a vehicle, and connected to "
"building's electric grid."
msgstr "차량에서 떼어낸 초대형 축전지로, 건물 전력망에 연결되어 있습니다."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
#: data/json/items/vehicle/utilities.json
#: data/json/vehicleparts/vehicle_parts.json
msgid "battery charger"
msgid_plural "battery chargers"
msgstr[0] "배터리 충전기"

#. ~ Description for battery charger
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
msgid "A battery charger connected to building's electric grid."
msgstr "건물의 전력망에 연결된 배터리 충전기."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
msgid "jumper cable connector"
msgstr "점퍼 케이블 커넥터"

#. ~ Description for jumper cable connector
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
msgid ""
"Power outlet connecting a building's electrical grid to a vehicle.  To use, "
"attach a jumper cable to a vehicle and then to the connector."
msgstr ""
"건물의 전력망에 연결되어 차량에 전력을 배출할 수 있는 전기 콘센트. 사용하려면 우선 점퍼 케이블 한 쪽을 차량에 연결하고, 다른 한 "
"쪽을 콘센트에 연결해야 합니다."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
#: data/json/items/fake.json
msgid "grid welder"
