msgstr[0] "토첸"

#. ~ Description for toettchen
#. ~ Description for tÖttchen
#: data/json/items/comestibles/offal_dishes.json
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "A German lung dish."
msgstr "독일식 허파 요리입니다."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/offal_dishes.json
msgid "scrambled eggs and brain"
msgid_plural "scrambled eggs and brains"
msgstr[0] "뇌 스크램블 에그"

#. ~ Description for scrambled eggs and brain
#: data/json/items/comestibles/offal_dishes.json
msgid "Brains and eggs, why didn't you ever think to put these together?"
msgstr "뇌와 달걀, 왜 전에는 이 두 가지를 결합할 생각을 못 했을까요?"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/offal_dishes.json
msgid "sausage casing"
msgid_plural "sausage casings"
msgstr[0] "소세지 껍질"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'sausage casing'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/offal_dishes.json
msgid ""
"Sausage casings made from animal intestines.  Ready to be used for forming "
"meat products."
msgstr "동물의 내장으로 만든 소세지 껍질입니다.  가공 육류를 만들기 위한 준비가 되어있습니다."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/offal_dishes.json
msgid "homemade hot dog"
msgid_plural "homemade hot dogs"
msgstr[0] "수제 핫도그"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
msgid "diet pill"
msgid_plural "diet pills"
msgstr[0] "다이어트 약"

#. ~ Description for diet pill
#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
msgid ""
"Not very nutritious.  Warning: contains calories, unsuitable for "
"breatharians."
msgstr "별로 영양가는 없습니다. 경고: 칼로리 있음, 기 호흡가 사용에 부적절함."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
msgid "blob glob"
msgid_plural "blob globs"
msgstr[0] "블럽 조각"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'blob glob'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
msgid ""
"A little hunk of glop that fell off a blob monster.  It doesn't seem "
"hostile, but it does wiggle occasionally."
msgstr "블럽 괴물에서 떨어진 작은 덩어리 조각입니다. 적대적이지는 않은 것 같지만, 가끔 꿈틀거립니다."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
msgid "honey comb"
msgid_plural "honey combs"
msgstr[0] "꿀벌집"

#. ~ Description for honey comb
#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
msgid "A large chunk of wax filled with honey.  Very tasty."
msgstr "꿀로 채워진 큰 밀랍 덩어리입니다. 아주 맛있습니다."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
msgid "wax"
msgid_plural "waxes"
msgstr[0] "밀랍"

#. ~ Description for {'str_pl': 'waxes', 'str': 'wax'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
msgid ""
"A large chunk of beeswax.  Not very tasty or nourishing, but okay in an "
"emergency."
msgstr "큰 밀랍 덩어리입니다. 그다지 맛있지도 않고, 영양소도 풍부하지 않지만, 배가 고프다면 이런 음식이라도 괜찮을 것 같습니다."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
msgid "royal jelly"
msgid_plural "royal jellies"
msgstr[0] "로얄 젤리"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'royal jelly', 'str_pl': 'royal jellies'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
msgid ""
"A translucent hexagonal chunk of wax, filled with dense, milky jelly.  "
"Though some hold it as a panacea, it doesn't have any medical benefit.  "
"Still, it is delicious, and rich with the most beneficial substances the "
"hive can produce."
msgstr ""
"반투명한 육각형 왁스 덩어리로, 농후하고 우유같은 젤리가 가득 채워져있습니다. 간혹 이걸 만병통치약으로 준비하는 사람이 있지만, 아무런 "
"의학적 효험도 없다는데 주의하세요. 여전히 맛있고, 벌집이 만들 수 있는 가장 이로운 물질들로 가득합니다."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
#: data/json/items/comestibles/seed.json
msgid "marloss berry"
msgid_plural "marloss berries"
msgstr[0] "말로스 열매"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'marloss berry', 'str_pl': 'marloss berries'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
msgid ""
"This looks like a blueberry the size of your fist, but pinkish in color.  It"
" has a strong but delicious aroma, but is clearly either mutated or of alien"
" origin."
msgstr ""
"블루베리와 비슷해보이며, 크기는 주먹 정도입니다만, 색은 분홍빛이 돕니다. 맛있는 향기가 강하게 나지만, 이 열매는 분명히 변이된 "
"것이거나 외계에서 왔을 겁니다."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
msgid "marloss gelatin"
msgid_plural "marloss gelatin"
msgstr[0] "말로스 젤라틴"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'marloss gelatin'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
msgid ""
"This looks like a handful of lemon-colored liquid which has taken a set, "
"much like pre-Cataclysm Jello.  It has a strong but delicious aroma, but is "
"clearly either mutated or of alien origin."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
msgid "mycus fruit"
msgid_plural "mycus fruits"
msgstr[0] "미커스 열매"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'mycus fruit'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
msgid ""
"Humans might call this a Gray Delicious apple: large, gray, and smells even "
"better than the Marloss.  If they didn't reject it for its alien origins.  "
"But we know better."
msgstr ""
"인간은 이것을 회색의 맛있는 사과라고 부르겠죠:크고, 회색이고, 말로스보다도 좋은 향기가 나니까 말입니다. 외계물질이라며 이걸 거부하지 "
"않았다면 말입니다만, 우리는 그렇지 않습니다."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
msgid "yeast"
msgid_plural "yeast"
msgstr[0] "이스트"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'yeast'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
msgid ""
"A powder-like mix of cultured yeast, good for baking and brewing alike."
msgstr "가루 형태로 배양된 효모입니다. 제빵이나 양조에 쓰입니다."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
msgid "bone meal"
msgid_plural "bone meal"
msgstr[0] "뼛가루"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'bone meal'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
msgid "This bone meal can be used to craft fertilizer and some other things."
msgstr "이 뼛가루는 비료와 다른 것들을 만드는 데 사용될 수 있다."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
msgid "tainted bone meal"
msgid_plural "tainted bone meal"
msgstr[0] "오염된 뼛가루"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'tainted bone meal'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
msgid "This is a grayish bone meal made from rotten bones."
msgstr "오염된 뼈를 갈아 만든 회색 뼛가루."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
msgid "chitin powder"
msgid_plural "chitin powder"
msgstr[0] "키틴질 가루"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'chitin powder'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
msgid ""
"This chitin powder can be used to craft fertilizer and some other things."
msgstr "이 키틴질 가루는 비료와 다른 것들을 만드는 데 사용될 수 있다."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
msgid "paper"
msgid_plural "papers"
msgstr[0] "종이"

#. ~ Description for paper
#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
msgid "A piece of paper.  Can be used for fires."
msgstr "종잇장으로, 불 피우는데 쓸 수 있습니다."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
msgid "cardboard"
msgid_plural "cardboards"
msgstr[0] "카드보드"

#. ~ Description for cardboard
#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
msgid "A piece of cardboard."
msgstr "카드보드 조각."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
msgid "canned beans"
msgid_plural "beans"
msgstr[0] "콩"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'canned beans', 'str_pl': 'beans'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
msgid ""
"Canned beans.  A staple among canned goods, these are reputedly good for "
"one's coronary health."
msgstr "통조림 콩입니다. 통조림 식품 중에서도 콩은 보통 건강에 좋은 것으로 알려졌습니다."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
msgid "dried beans"
msgid_plural "dried beans"
msgstr[0] "말린 콩"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'dried beans'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
msgid ""
"Dehydrated great northern beans.  Tasty and nutritious when cooked, "
"virtually inedible when dry."
msgstr "마른 흰콩. 조리하면 배부르고 맛있게 먹을 수 있지만, 건조된 상태로는 먹기 힘들다."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
msgid "cooked beans"
msgid_plural "cooked beans"
msgstr[0] "콩 (요리됨)"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'cooked beans'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
msgid "A hearty serving of cooked great northern beans."
msgstr "따뜻하게 조리된 북부 대형 콩."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
msgid "tofu"
msgid_plural "tofu"
msgstr[0] "두부"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'tofu'}
#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'fried tofu'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
msgid ""
"Tofu, a soy protein crucial to East Asian cuisine.  It absorbs flavors very "
"well and can be used as a meat alternative in many dishes."
msgstr "동아시아 식단에서 중요한 콩단백질인 두부입니다. 향을 무척 잘 흡수하며 많은 요리에서 고기의 대체품으로 쓸 수 있습니다."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
msgid "fried tofu"
msgid_plural "fried tofu"
msgstr[0] "구운 두부"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
msgid "dehydrated tofu"
msgid_plural "dehydrated tofu"
msgstr[0] "말린 두부"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'dehydrated tofu'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
msgid "Dehydrated tofu, sealed and still extra firm to last a long time."
msgstr "말린 두부입니다. 잘 밀봉되어있으며 아주 오랫동안 보존할 수 있습니다."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
msgid "soybeans"
msgid_plural "soybeans"
msgstr[0] "대두"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'soybeans'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
msgid ""
"Light brown beans, they have many uses, mildly toxic and not recommended, "
"but you could eat them raw."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
msgid "raw edamame"
msgid_plural "raw edamames"
msgstr[0] "생 완두콩"

#. ~ Description for raw edamame
#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
msgid ""
"Light green raw edamame still in its pod, you should boil or freeze these, "
"or you could eat them while they are still toxic."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
msgid "dried lentils"
msgid_plural "dried lentils"
msgstr[0] "말린 렌틸 콩"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'dried lentils'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
msgid ""
"A humble but nutrient-rich legume.  Should be cooked prior to consumption."
msgstr "소박하지만 영양이 풍부한 콩입니다. 조리해야 더 쉽게 먹을 수 있을 것 같습니다"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
msgid "Foodplace's delicious food™"
msgid_plural "Foodplace's delicious food™"
msgstr[0] "푸드플레이스의 맛있는 음식™"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': "Foodplace's delicious food™"}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
msgid ""
"The best-seller from Foodplace, delicious food™, is made with real foodstuff"
" and is guaranteed 100% edible!"
msgstr "푸드플레이스의 베스트셀러인 맛있는 음식™은 진짜 식재료로 만들어졌으며, 100% 먹을 수 있음을 보증합니다!"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
msgid "cooked lentils"
msgid_plural "cooked lentils"
msgstr[0] "구운 렌틸콩"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'cooked lentils'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
msgid "Some delicious cooked lentils.  Humble but nutrient-rich."
msgstr "맛있게 조리된 렌틸콩입니다. 겉보기엔 보잘 것 없지만, 영양이 풍부합니다."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
msgid "coffee powder"
msgid_plural "coffee powder"
msgstr[0] "커피 가루"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'coffee powder'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
msgid ""
"Ground coffee beans.  You can boil it into a mediocre stimulant, or "
"something better if you had an atomic coffee pot."
msgstr ""
"갈아낸 커피 원두입니다. 애매한 각성제가 되게끔 끓일 수 있지만, 방사능 커피 제조기가 있다면 더 나은 무언가를 만드는데 쓸 수도 "
"있습니다."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
msgid "Kentucky coffee grounds"
msgid_plural "Kentucky coffee grounds"
msgstr[0] "켄터키 커피 가루"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'Kentucky coffee grounds'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
msgid ""
"Coffee grounds created through washing, cleaning, and roasting the pods from"
" a Kentucky coffeetree.  They can be used to create coffee."
msgstr "켄터키 커피나무의 열매를 세척하고, 닦아내고, 구워서 만든 커피 가루입니다. 커피를 만드는데 쓸 수 있습니다."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
msgid "candied honey"
msgid_plural "candied honey"
msgstr[0] "굳은 꿀"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'candied honey'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
msgid ""
"Honey, that stuff the bees make.  This variant is \"candied honey\", a "
"variant of very thick consistence.  This honey won't spoil and is good for "
"your digestion."
msgstr "액상의 벌이 만든 벌꿀로 아주 뻑뻑하게 굳은 \"굳은 꿀\"이다. 이 꿀은 절대 상하지 않고 소화하기 좋다."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
msgid "canned tomato"
msgid_plural "canned tomatoes"
msgstr[0] "토마토 통조림"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'canned tomato', 'str_pl': 'canned tomatoes'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
msgid ""
"Canned tomato.  A staple in many pantries, and useful for many recipes."
msgstr "토마토 통조림. 일반적인 식료품 저장고의 주 구성품으로, 여러 조리법에 유용하게 사용된다."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
msgid "embalmed human brain"
msgid_plural "embalmed human brains"
msgstr[0] "방부처리한 인간의 뇌"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'embalmed human brain'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
msgid ""
"This is a human brain soaked in a solution of highly toxic formaldehyde.  "
"Eating this would be a terrible idea."
msgstr "매우 독한 포름알데히드에 절인 인간뇌. 이걸 먹는 건 좋은 생각이 아닌 것 같다. "

#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
msgid "cattle fodder"
msgid_plural "cattle fodder"
msgstr[0] "소 사료"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'cattle fodder'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
msgid ""
"What cattle eat.  Mainly made of grass, silage or legumes.  It's perfect for"
" ruminants."
msgstr "소가 먹는 것. 주로 풀, 목초 또는 콩과 식물로 만듭니다. 반추동물에게 적합합니다."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
msgid "bird food"
msgid_plural "bird food"
msgstr[0] "새 사료"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'bird food'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
msgid ""
"What birds eat.  Mainly made of seeds, silage or legumes.  It's perfect for "
"small birds."
msgstr "새가 먹는 음식. 주로 씨앗, 풀 그리고 콩이 섞여있다. 작은 새의 먹이로 완벽하다.  "

#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
msgid "dog food"
msgid_plural "dog food"
msgstr[0] "개 사료"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'dog food'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
msgid "This is food for dogs.  It smells strange, but dogs seem to love it."
msgstr "애견용 사료이다. 이상한 냄새가 나지만, 개들은 좋아하는것 같다."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
msgid "cat food"
msgid_plural "cat food"
msgstr[0] "고양이 사료"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'cat food'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
msgid "This is food for cats.  It smells strange, but cats seem to love it."
msgstr "고양이 사료이다. 이상한 냄새가 나지만, 고양이들은 좋아하는것 같다."

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'grass', 'str_pl': 'grasses'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
msgid ""
"Some grass, edible by grazers and ruminants only.  Seeing this item is a "
"bug."
msgstr "잔디입니다. 방목 가축과 반추동물만 먹을 수 있습니다. 이걸 보고 있다면 버그입니다."

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'underbrush', 'str_pl': 'underbrushes'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
msgid "Some underbrush, edible by ruminants only.  Seeing this item is a bug."
msgstr "덤불입니다. 반추동물만 먹을 수 있습니다. 이걸 보고 있다면 버그입니다."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
msgid "nectar"
msgid_plural "nectars"
msgstr[0] "넥타르"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'nectar'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
msgid "Some nectar.  Seeing this item is a bug."
msgstr "넥타르입니다. 이걸 보고 있다면 버그입니다."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/protein.json
msgid "protein drink"
msgid_plural "protein drinks"
msgstr[0] "프로틴 음료"

#. ~ Conditional name for protein drink when FLAG matches CANNIBALISM
#: data/json/items/comestibles/protein.json
msgid "soylent green drink"
msgid_plural "soylent green drinks"
msgstr[0] "소일렌트 그린 음료"

#. ~ Conditional name for protein drink when COMPONENT_ID matches mutant
#. ~ Conditional name for {'str_sp': 'protein powder'} when COMPONENT_ID
#. matches mutant
#. ~ Conditional name for protein shake when COMPONENT_ID matches mutant
#. ~ Conditional name for fortified protein shake when COMPONENT_ID matches
#. mutant
#: data/json/items/comestibles/protein.json
#, c-format
msgid "perturbing %s"
msgid_plural "perturbing %s"
msgstr[0] "괴이한 %s"

#. ~ Description for protein drink
#: data/json/items/comestibles/protein.json
msgid ""
"A thin slurry of refined protein mixed with water.  While quite nutritious, "
"it is not particularly tasty."
msgstr "정제된 단백질과 물을 섞어 만든, 약간 걸쭉한 액체입니다. 꽤 영양소가 높지만, 아직 별로 맛은 없습니다."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/protein.json
msgid "protein powder"
msgid_plural "protein powder"
msgstr[0] "프로틴 가루"

#. ~ Conditional name for {'str_sp': 'protein powder'} when FLAG matches
#. CANNIBALISM
#: data/json/items/comestibles/protein.json
msgid "soylent green powder"
msgid_plural "soylent green powder"
msgstr[0] "소일렌트 그린 가루"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'protein powder'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/protein.json
msgid ""
"Raw, refined protein.  While quite nutritious, it is impossible to enjoy in "
"its pure form, try adding water."
msgstr "정제된 단백질 가루입니다. 꽤 영양소가 높지만, 가공하지 않고 먹기는 불가능에 가까우니 물에 타서 섭취하십시오."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/protein.json
msgid "protein ration"
msgid_plural "protein rations"
msgstr[0] "프로틴 식료품"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'protein ration'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/protein.json
msgid ""
"SoyPelusa ran a highly successful crowdfunding campaign for this protein "
"bar.  A person can live on one of these bars, three times a day, presumably "
"forever.  After backers received their product, a single flaw was found: "
"most consumers found starvation preferable to the flavor.  Warehouses of the"
" product went unsold as the company went bankrupt, providing the perfect "
"opportunity for FEMA to scoop them up and stock the evac shelters.  Now, you"
" hold a piece of famous crowdfunding history in your hands.  How exciting."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/comestibles/protein.json
