msgid ""
"This is an active grenade, and will explode any second now.  Better throw "
"it!"
msgstr "핀이 까진 수류탄, 곧 터질것이니 얼른 던지세요!"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "EMP grenade"
msgid_plural "EMP grenades"
msgstr[0] "EMP 수류탄"

#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'EMP grenade'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "You pull the pin on the EMP grenade."
msgstr "EMP 수류탄 핀을 뽑았다."

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'EMP grenade'}
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid ""
"This is a grenade that generates an electromagnetic pulse with a low-"
"inductance capacitor bank discharged into a single-loop antenna.  Use this "
"item to pull the pin and light the fuse, turning it into an active EMP "
"grenade.  You will then have three turns before it detonates, creating an "
"EMP field that damages robots and drains bionic energy."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/grenade.json
#: data/mods/Salvaged_Robots/robot_additions/40mm.json
msgid "active EMP grenade"
msgid_plural "active EMP grenades"
msgstr[0] "EMP 수류탄 (켜짐)"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'active EMP grenade'}
#. ~ Description for active EMP grenade
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/grenade.json
#: data/mods/Salvaged_Robots/robot_additions/40mm.json
msgid ""
"This EMP grenade is active, and will shortly detonate, creating a large EMP "
"field that damages robots and drains bionic energy.  You may not want to be "
"holding it much longer."
msgstr ""
"켜진 EMP 수류탄, 곧 터질것이고, 거대한 EMP 필드를 생성시켜 로봇에게 피해를 주고 바이오닉 에너지를 고갈시킵니다. 손에 계속 들고"
" 있지 않는게 좋을걸요."

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "incendiary grenade"
msgid_plural "incendiary grenades"
msgstr[0] "소이 수류탄"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'incendiary grenade'}
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid ""
"This is a military-grade incendiary hand grenade.  Use this item to pull the"
" pin and light the fuse.  You will then have five turns before it explodes "
"into a raging inferno; throwing it would be a good idea."
msgstr ""
"군용 소이 수류탄입니다. 사용하여 안전핀을 뽑고 도화선에 불을 당깁니다. 이후 불지옥을 일으킬 폭발까지 5초가 걸리니, 던져버리는게 "
"좋을겁니다."

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "active incendiary grenade"
msgid_plural "active incendiary grenades"
msgstr[0] "소이 수류탄 (켜짐)"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'active incendiary grenade'}
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid ""
"This is an active incendiary grenade, likely to burst into an inferno any "
"second now.  Better throw it!"
msgstr "핀이 뽑힌 소이 수류탄. 머지않아 폭발해 불지옥을 일으킬 것입니다. 어서 던지세요!"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "canister grenade"
msgid_plural "canister grenades"
msgstr[0] "파편 수류탄"

#. ~ Use action message for {'str': 'canister grenade'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "You pull the pin on the %s."
msgstr "%s 핀을 뽑았다."

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "tear gas grenade"
msgid_plural "tear gas grenades"
msgstr[0] "최루탄"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'tear gas grenade'}
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid ""
"This is a canister grenade filled with noxious irritant.  Use this item to "
"pull the pin and light the fuse, turning it into an active tear gas grenade."
"  In five turns it will begin to expel a highly toxic gas for some time.  "
"This gas damages and slows those who enter it, as well as obscuring vision "
"and scent."
msgstr ""
"유해한 자극물이 들어있는 수류탄. 사용하면 핀을 뽑아 도화선에 불이 붙어 점화합니다. 유독한 가스를 내뿜기 전까지 5턴이 남았습니다. 이"
" 가스는 상대방의 행동을 느리게 만들고, 시야와 냄새까지 차단해 줍니다."

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "armed tear gas canister"
msgid_plural "armed tear gas canisters"
msgstr[0] "최루탄 (켜짐)"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'armed tear gas canister'}
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid ""
"This smoke bomb has had its pin removed and is expelling highly toxic gas."
msgstr "핀이 뽑힌 연막탄으로, 극히 독성이 높은 가스를 내뿜고 있습니다."

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
