#: data/json/items/vehicle/cables.json
#: data/json/vehicleparts/vehicle_parts.json
msgid "jumper cable"
msgid_plural "jumper cables"
msgstr[0] "점퍼 케이블"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'jumper cable'}
#: data/json/items/vehicle/cables.json
msgid ""
"A jumper cable, like you've seen many times before: it's a short multi-"
"stranded copper cable with power leads on either end, whose main purpose is "
"to share power between vehicles, but can also link other electrical systems."
msgstr ""
"당신이 익히 보아온 점퍼 케이블입니다. 여러 가닥의 짧은 구리선을 하나로 꼰 것으로, 한쪽 끝과 다른 끝 간에 전력이 이어지게 "
