#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "Follow same rules as this follower."
msgstr "이 친구와 같은 규칙을 따라줘."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "Don't pick up items."
msgstr "물건들을 줍지마."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "You can pick up items now."
msgstr "이제 다시 물건들을 주워도 돼."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "Don't bash obstacles."
msgstr "장애물을 때리지마."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "You can bash obstacles."
msgstr "장애물을 때려도 돼."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "Stay awake."
msgstr "계속 깨어있어."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "Sleep when you feel tired."
msgstr "피곤할때 자."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "Stay quiet."
msgstr "조용히 있어."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "Tell me when you need something."
msgstr "뭔가 필요하면 말해줘."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "Leave corpses alone."
msgstr "좀비 시체를 내버려 둬."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "Smash zombie corpses."
msgstr "좀비 시체를 박살 내."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "Leave doors open."
msgstr "문을 열어 둬."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "Close the doors."
msgstr "문을 닫아 둬."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "Open doors to get where you're going."
msgstr "가는 방향에 닫힌 문이 있으면 열어."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "Don't walk through closed doors."
msgstr "닫힌 문들을 이용하지마."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "If you hear a noise but can't see the source, move to investigate it."
msgstr "보이지 않는 곳에서 무슨 소리가 들리면, 이동해서 조사하도록 해."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "Don't investigate noises that you can't see."
msgstr "보이지 않는 곳에서 소리가 들려도 조사하지마."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "Set up pickup rules."
msgstr "줍기 규칙 설정."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "Clear all overrides."
msgstr "모든 명령을 지우기"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "You're really leaving?"
msgstr "정말 떠날거야?"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "Yeah, I'm sure.  Bye."
msgstr "그래, 확실해. 안녕."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "Nah, I'm just kidding."
msgstr "아니, 그냥 농담이야."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "Please go to this location…"
msgstr "이 장소로 가줘..."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "Stay at your current position."
msgstr "그 자리에서 움직이지 마."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json data/json/npcs/TALK_FACTION_CAMP.json
msgid "Show me what needs to be done at the camp."
msgstr "캠프에 필요한 일들을 알려줘."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "I'm currently <current_activity>."
msgstr "난 지금 <current_activity> 중이야."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "I'm not doing much currently."
msgstr "아무 활동도 하지 않고 있어."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "I meant what are your goals?"
msgstr "내 말은 네 목표가 뭐냐는 뜻이었어."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "Carry on."
msgstr "계속 해."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "Please stop your current activity."
msgstr "현재 활동을 멈춰."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "Please sort out some of these items nearby."
msgstr "주변 물품들 좀 정리해줘."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "Please do any construction work that you can."
msgstr "네 능력에 한해서 아무 거나 지어줘."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "Please do any mining work that you can."
msgstr "네 능력에 한해서 아무거나 채광해줘."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "Please study from a book."
msgstr "책으로 공부 해줘."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "Please start deconstructing any vehicles in a deconstruction zone."
msgstr "해체 지점에 있는 차량들을 수리해줘."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "Please start repairing any vehicles in a repair zone."
msgstr "수리 지점에 있는 차량들을 수리해줘."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "Please chop logs into planks."
msgstr "통나무를 널빤지로 가공해줘."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "Please butcher any corpses that you can."
msgstr "아무 시체나 도축해줘."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "Please chop any trees in the designated areas."
msgstr "지정된 곳에 있는 나무들을 벌목해줘."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "Please go catch some fish."
msgstr "가서 물고기들을 낚시해 와."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "Please do some farming work."
msgstr "농장 일 좀 해줘."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "*pssshht* ten-four, I'll make my way there, over."
msgstr "*치지직* 10-4(알았다), 지금 출발한다, 오버."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid "Affirmative."
msgstr "확인."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "Sure thing, I'll make my way there."
msgstr "물론이지, 그곳으로 향할게."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "<noticedbooze>"
msgstr "<noticedbooze>"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "<neutralchitchat>"
msgstr "<neutralchitchat>"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid ""
"Yeah, this summer heat is hitting me hard, let's take a quick break, how "
"goes it <name_g>?"
msgstr "으어, 여름 더위 참 끝내주네. 우리 좀 쉬었다 하면 안될까, <name_g>?"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "OK, maybe it'll stop me from freezing in this weather, what's up?"
msgstr "그래, 이런 날씨에 내가 얼지 않게 해줄지도 몰라, 무슨 일이야?"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid ""
"Well, it's the time of day for a quick break surely!  How are you holding "
"up?"
msgstr "뭐, 확실히 잠깐 휴식을 취하기 적당한 시간이긴하네!  별일 없지?"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "Man it's dark out isn't it? what's up?"
msgstr "밖이 깜깜하네, 그렇지?  무슨 일이야?"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "Well, I'm feeling pretty sick… are you doing OK though?"
msgstr "뭐, 기분이 좋지는 않아... 넌 괜찮아?"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid ""
"Definitely, by the way, thanks for helping me so much with my tasks!  "
"Anyway, you coping OK, <name_g>? "
msgstr "그건 그렇고, 내 작업을 그렇게나 도와주다니 정말 고마워!  어쨌든, 별일 없지, <name_g>?"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid ""
"OK, let's take a moment, oh, and thanks for helping me with that thing, so… "
"what's up?"
msgstr "그래, 잠시 쉬자.  오, 그리고 도와줘서 고마워.  그래서, 무슨 일이야?"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid ""
"Now, we've got a moment, I was just thinking it's been a month or so since… "
"since all this, how are you coping with it all?"
msgstr ""
"이제야 조금 시간이 나네. 그냥 몇 개월이나 지났나 생각하고 있었어, 이... 모든 일이 벌어지고 나서.  넌 어떻게 지내고 있어?"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "Oh you know, not bad, not bad…"
msgstr "오 너도 알잖아, 별일 없어..."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
msgid "<hallu_dont_trade>"
msgstr "<hallu_dont_trade>"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json data/json/npcs/TALK_FACTION_CAMP.json
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
msgid "Fair enough."
msgstr "괜찮네."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_GREET.json
msgid "Another survivor!  We should travel together."
msgstr "다른 생존자라니! 같이 움직이자."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_GREET.json
msgid "What are you doing?"
msgstr "뭐하는 중이야?"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_GREET.json
msgid "Care to trade?"
msgstr "거래할 생각 있나?"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_GREET.json
msgid "&Put away weapon."
msgstr "&무기를 치운다."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_GREET.json
msgid "&Drop weapon."
msgstr "&무기를 떨어트린다."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_GREET.json
msgid "Don't worry, I'm not going to hurt you"
msgstr "걱정하지 마, 다치게 할 생각은 없어"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_GREET.json
msgid "Drop your weapon!"
msgstr "무기 버려!"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_GREET.json
msgid "Get out of here or I'll kill you."
msgstr "여기서 꺼지지 않으면 죽여버리겠어."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_GREET.json
msgid "Hey there, <name_g>."
msgstr "안녕, <name_g>."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_GREET.json data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
#: src/npctalk.cpp
msgid "Bye."
msgstr "잘가."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_GREET.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard1.json
msgid "Hello there."
msgstr "안녕."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_GREET.json
msgid "Okay, no sudden movements..."
msgstr "좋아, 가만히 있으라고..."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_GREET.json
msgid "Keep your distance!"
msgstr "가까이 오지마!"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_GREET.json
msgid "<drop_it>"
msgstr "<drop_it>"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_GREET.json
msgid "This is my territory, <name_b>."
msgstr "<name_b>, 여긴 내 구역이야."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_GREET.json
msgid "Calm down.  I'm not going to hurt you."
msgstr "진정해. 난 너에게 해코지할 생각이 없어."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_GREET.json
msgid "Screw you, no."
msgstr "엿이나 먹어, 당연히 안돼."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_GREET.json
msgid "<hands_up>"
msgstr "<hands_up>"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_GREET.json
msgid "&Put hands up."
msgstr "&손을 든다."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_GREET.json
msgid "*drops his weapon."
msgstr "*무기를 떨어뜨린다."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_GREET.json
msgid "*drops_her_weapon."
msgstr "*무기를 떨어뜨린다."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_GREET.json
msgid "Now get out of here"
msgstr "이제 여기서 나가."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_GREET.json
msgid "Now get out of here, before I kill you."
msgstr "내가 죽여버리기 전에 꺼져."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_GREET.json
msgid "Okay, I'm going."
msgstr "알았어. 가는 중이야."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
msgid "About that job…"
msgstr "시킨 일 말인데..."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
msgid "About one of those jobs…"
msgstr "시켰던 일 말인데..."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
msgid "What's the matter?"
msgstr "뭐가 문제야?"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
msgid "I don't care."
msgstr "내가 알 바 아냐."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
msgid "I don't have any jobs for you."
msgstr "너한테 시킬 일 없어."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
msgid "I don't have any more jobs for you."
msgstr "더 시킬 일은 없어."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
msgid "I have other jobs for you.  Want to hear about them?"
msgstr "그거 말고 달리 해줬으면 하는 일이 있어. 들어볼래?"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
msgid "I have more jobs for you.  Want to hear about them?"
msgstr "더 해줬으면 하는 일이 있어. 들어볼래?"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
msgid "I have a job for you.  Want to hear about it?"
msgstr "네게 맡길 일이 있어.  들어볼래?"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
msgid "I just have one job for you.  Want to hear about it?"
msgstr "해줬으면 하는 일이 있어. 들어볼래?"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json data/json/npcs/godco/cook.json
#: data/json/npcs/godco/foodguard.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard1.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_generic_dialogue.json src/npctalk.cpp
msgid "Oh, okay."
msgstr "오. 알았어."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
msgid "Never mind, I'm not interested."
msgstr "아무것도 아냐, 관심 없어."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
msgid "You're not working on anything for me now."
msgstr "지금 날 도와주고 있는 것 같지는 않네."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
msgid "Which job?"
msgstr "무슨 일?"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
msgid "What about it?"
msgstr "이건 어때?"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_INTERCOM.json
msgid "I'll do it!"
msgstr "내가 하지!"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
msgid "Not a problem."
msgstr "그 정돈 쉽지."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_INTERCOM.json
msgid "Got any advice?"
msgstr "해줄 충고라도 있나?"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
msgid "Can you share some equipment?"
msgstr "몇 가지 장비좀 나눠줄 수 있어?"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_INTERCOM.json
msgid "I'll be back soon!"
msgstr "곧 돌아갈게!"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
msgid "Sounds good, thanks."
msgstr "괜찮은 생각인데, 고마워."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
msgid "Sounds good.  Bye!"
msgstr "좋은 생각같네. 안녕!"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
msgid "I'm sorry."
msgstr "미안."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
msgid "Whatever.  Bye."
msgstr "마음대로 해. 안녕."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
msgid "I'm sorry…  I failed."
msgstr "미안... 실패했어."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
msgid "Not yet."
msgstr "아직 아니야."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
msgid "I killed him."
msgstr "죽였어."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
msgid "I killed it."
msgstr "죽였어."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
msgid "No.  I'll get back to it, bye!"
msgstr "아니. 하러 갈게. 안녕!"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
msgid "Yup!  Here it is!"
msgstr "그래! 여기 있어!"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
msgid "We're here!"
msgstr "도착했다!"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
msgid "Here I am."
msgstr "여기 있어."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
msgid "I talked to them."
msgstr "얘기했어."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
msgid "Here it is!"
msgstr "여기 있어!"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
msgid "Justice has been served."
msgstr "정의는 구현되었어."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
msgid "I killed them.  All of them."
msgstr "죽였어. 전부."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
msgid "I brought 'em."
msgstr "여기."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
msgid "I've taken care of it"
msgstr "네가 돌보지."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
msgid ""
"I found it, but I'm keeping it, and I'll find you another one.  Let's talk "
"about something else."
msgstr "찾긴 했는데, 나도 하나 필요해서. 다른 거 찾으면 줄게. 다른 얘기 하자."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
msgid "I found it, but I'm keeping it, and I'll find you another one.  Bye!"
msgstr "찾아서 갖고 있긴 하지만, 너에겐 다른걸 가져다 줄게.  안녕!"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
msgid "Mission success!"
msgstr "임무 성공!"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
msgid "Glad to help.  I need no payment."
msgstr "도와줘서 기쁘군. 보상은 필요없어."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
msgid "How about some items as payment?"
msgstr "보답으로 물건을 주는건 어때?"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
msgid "Maybe you can teach me something as payment?"
msgstr "보답으로 뭔가 가르쳐줄 수도 있겠지."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
msgid "Glad to help.  I need no payment.  Bye!"
msgstr "도와줘서 기쁘군. 보상은 필요 없어. 안녕!"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
msgid "Glad to help."
msgstr "도와줘서 기쁘군."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
msgid "Glad to help.  Bye!"
msgstr "도와줘서 기쁘군. 안녕!"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
msgid "Well, um, sorry."
msgstr "어, 음. 미안."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
msgid "I'm sorry.  I did what I could."
msgstr "미안. 내가 할 수 있는걸 한거야."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
msgid "Sure, here you go!"
msgstr "물론, 여기 있어!"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
msgid "Thank you."
msgstr "고맙군."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
msgid "Thanks, bye."
msgstr "고마워. 잘가."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Well, I guess it's just us."
msgstr "흠, 우리 뿐인 것 같네."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "At least we've got shelter."
msgstr "최소한 피난처는 있잖아."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "What should we do now?"
msgstr "이제 뭘 해야하지?"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Any tips?"
msgstr "조언 좀 해줄래?"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Want to travel with me?"
msgstr "나하고 같이 여행할래?"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Want to share some useful items with me?"
msgstr "유용한 물건 좀 나눠줄래?"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json data/json/npcs/holdouts/Mr_Lapin.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_old_guard_doctor.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_arsonist.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_scavenger_mercenary.json
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/ROBOFAC_SURFACE_FREEMERCHANT.json
#: data/mods/Fuji_Structures/npc/TALK_BUNKER_MERCHANT.json
msgid "Well, bye."
msgstr "그럼, 잘 가."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "I don't know, look for supplies and other survivors I guess."
msgstr "글쎄, 보급품하고 다른 생존자를 찾아보는 건 어떨까."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Maybe we should start boarding up this place."
msgstr "아마 우린 여기를 떠나는 게 좋을 것 같아."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid ""
"I suppose getting a car up and running should really be useful if we have to"
" disappear quickly from here."
msgstr "여기서 빨리 벗어나고 싶으면 작동하는 차를 한 대 얻는 게 제일 좋을 거야."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid ""
"We could look for one of those farms out here.  They can provide plenty of "
"food and aren't close to the cities."
msgstr "밖에 있는 농장을 살펴볼 수도 있지. 도심과도 멀리 떨어져 있고 음식도 많으니까."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid ""
"We should probably stay away from those cities, even if there's plenty of "
"useful stuff there."
msgstr "도심에서 멀어지는 게 좋을 거야. 유용한 물건이 많이 남아있긴 하겠지만."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Hmm, okay."
msgstr "흠, 좋아."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Thanks!"
msgstr "고마워!"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Focus on the road, mate!"
msgstr "길에 집중하쇼, 친구!"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "I must focus on the road!"
msgstr "길에 집중해야해!"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "I'm too thirsty, give me something to drink."
msgstr "너무 목말라, 뭔가 마실 것좀 주겠어?"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "I'm too hungry, give me something to eat."
msgstr "너무 배고파, 뭔가 먹을 것 좀 주겠어?"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "I'm too tired, let me rest first."
msgstr "너무 지쳤어, 조금만 쉬게 해줘."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Nothing comes to my mind now.  Ask me later perhaps?"
msgstr "떠오르는 게 없네. 나중에 다시 물어봐줄래?"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "I have some reason for not telling you."
msgstr "얘기하지 않는 게 좋을 것 같아."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Ah, okay."
msgstr "아, 그래."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Not until I get some antibiotics..."
msgstr "항생제를 얻기 전까지는 안 돼."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "You asked me recently; ask again later."
msgstr "최근에 물어봤잖아. 나중에 물어봐."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Why should I travel with you?"
msgstr "내가 왜 너하고 같이 가야하는데?"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Understood.  I'll get those antibiotics."
msgstr "알았어. 항생제를 가져다주지."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Right, right, I'll ask later."
msgstr "그래, 그래, 나중에 물어보지."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "I can keep you safe."
msgstr "널 지켜줄 수 있으니까."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "You can keep me safe."
msgstr "네가 날 지켜줄 수 있으니까."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "We're friends, aren't we?"
msgstr "친구니까?"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "I'll kill you if you don't."
msgstr "아니면 죽여버리겠어."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json src/iuse.cpp
msgid "Nevermind."
msgstr "신경쓰지마."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "You got it, I'm with you!"
msgstr "그래, 같이 가지!"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Awesome!"
msgstr "훌륭해!"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Okay, let's go!"
msgstr "좋았어, 가자!"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Yeah… I don't think so."
msgstr "음... 아니."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "What is it?"
msgstr "뭐야?"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid "How much further?"
msgstr "얼마나 더 멀리?"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "I'd like to lead for a while."
msgstr "잠깐 지휘해줬으면 좋겠는데."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Step aside.  I'm leader now."
msgstr "물러 서. 내가 앞장설게."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Alright.  You can lead now."
msgstr "좋아. 네가 앞장서."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Good.  Something else…"
msgstr "좋아. 다른 얘긴데..."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Alright, let's go."
msgstr "좋아, 가자."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Okay, okay."
msgstr "좋아, 좋아."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Alright, let's begin."
msgstr "좋아, 시작해볼까."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Sounds good."
msgstr "그거 좋네."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Okay.  Lead the way."
msgstr "좋아. 앞장서."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "No, we'll be okay here."
msgstr "아니, 이대로도 괜찮아."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "On second thought, never mind."
msgstr "다시 생각해봤어. 신경 쓰지마."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "I can't train you properly while you're operating a vehicle!"
msgstr "네가 차량을 운전하는 동안에는 기술을 가르쳐줄 수 없어!"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "I can't train you properly while I'm operating a vehicle!"
msgstr "내가 차량을 운전하는 동안에는 기술을 가르쳐줄 수 없어!"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Give it some time, I'll show you something new later..."
msgstr "시간을 좀 줘, 나중에 새로운 걸 보여 줄게..."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "I have some reason for denying you training."
msgstr "가르쳐주지 않는 게 좋을 것 같아."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Not a bloody chance, I'm going to get left behind!"
msgstr "절대 안 되지. 그랬다간 뒤쳐질 걸!"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_barber.json
msgid "Fine."
msgstr "좋아."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "I'm on watch."
msgstr "경계 중이야."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "I need you to come with me."
msgstr "같이 가줬으면 해."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json data/json/npcs/TALK_FACTION_CAMP.json
msgid "See you around."
msgstr "또 봐."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "I really don't feel comfortable doing so..."
msgstr "자꾸 그러는 거 굉장히 불편한데..."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "I'll give you some space."
msgstr "혼자 있게 비켜줄게."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "I'd prefer to keep that to myself."
msgstr "그냥 마음속에 담아 두는게 좋겠어."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "I understand…"
msgstr "이해했어…"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "You just asked me for stuff; ask later."
msgstr "방금 장비를 달라고 했잖아. 나중에 물어보라고."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Why should I share my equipment with you?"
msgstr "왜 내가 너하고 장비를 나눠야 되는데?"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Okay, fine."
msgstr "좋아, 알았어."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Because I'm holding a thermal detonator!"
msgstr "내가 서멀 디토네이터를 들고 있기 때문이지! (스타워즈 패러디)"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Because I'm your friend!"
msgstr "친구잖아!"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Well, I am helping you out…"
msgstr "지금 내가 널 도와주려고 하니까?"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "I'll give it back!"
msgstr "나중에 돌려줄게!"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Give it to me, or else!"
msgstr "내놓든가, 아니면!"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json src/npctalk.cpp
msgid "Eh, never mind."
msgstr "어... 아무것도 아냐."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Never mind, I'll do without.  Bye."
msgstr "잊어버려. 알아서 할게. 안녕."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Okay, here you go."
msgstr "좋아. 이거 받아."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Thank you!"
msgstr "고마워!"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Thanks!  But can I have some more?"
msgstr "고마워! 그런데 좀 더 가질 수 있을까?"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Thanks, see you later!"
msgstr "고마워, 나중에 봐!"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "You picked up something that does not belong to you..."
msgstr "지금 네 것이 아닌 물건을 주웠는데..."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Okay, okay, this is all a misunderstanding.  Sorry, I'll drop it now."
msgstr "미안, 미안. 오해야. 지금 버릴게."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "No, I'm keeping it.  Try and take it off me, I dare you."
msgstr "싫은데? 어디 한 번 가져가봐."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Look, I really need this.  Please let me have it."
msgstr "제발, 이게 정말 필요해. 가지게 해줘."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "What, this?  It's not the same one, you are mistaken."
msgstr "이거? 내 거 맞는데. 헷갈린 거 아냐?"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "I'm sorry.  Look, I already dropped it, okay?"
msgstr "미안해. 이미 버렸어."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Don't try and talk yourself out of this, drop it now."
msgstr "이걸로 야부리 깔 생각 하지도 마. 지금 버려."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Okay, I'm dropping it…"
msgstr "좋아, 버릴게."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Just this once, you can keep it.  Don't tell anyone else."
msgstr "이번만이야. 다른 사람에게는 말하지 말고."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
#: data/json/npcs/necropolis/NPC_Old_Guard_Commo.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid "Thanks."
msgstr "고마워."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Right… I don't want any trouble."
msgstr "알았어... 문제 일으키고 싶지는 않아."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Smart choice."
msgstr "똑똑하군."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "<no>, and if you ask again, <ill_kill_you>!"
msgstr "<no>, 또 물어보면 <ill_kill_you>!"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "<no><punc> <fuck_you>!"
msgstr "<no>, <fuck_you><punc>!"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Okay, okay, sorry."
msgstr "알았어 알았어.. 미안해."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Seriously, give me more stuff!"
msgstr "장난치지 말고, 좀 더 줘!"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Okay, fine, bye."
msgstr "그래, 좋아, 안녕."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Okay"
msgstr "알았어"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid ""
"I'm willing to pay <topic_item_price> per batch for a total of "
"<topic_item_your_total_price>."
msgstr "한 묶음당 <topic_item_price>으로 해서 총합 <topic_item_your_total_price>."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Works for me."
msgstr "나한테는 맞던데."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_woodcutter1.json
msgid "Maybe later."
msgstr "아마 나중에."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Pleasure doing business!"
msgstr "다음에 필요하면 또 오라고!"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "You might be seeing more of me…"
msgstr "종종 나랑 마주칠 수 있을 거야..."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CYBORG_1.json
msgid "Hey again. *kzzz*"
msgstr "*치직* 또 만나네."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CYBORG_1.json
msgid ""
"I… I'm free. *Zzzt* I'm actually free! *bzzz* Look, you're the first person "
"I've seen in a long time."
msgstr "자... 자유다. *치직* 진짜 자유! *치지직* 이봐, 당신이 내가 갇힌 이후 처음으로 본 사람이야."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CYBORG_1.json data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "Hey.  Let's chat for a second."
msgstr "이봐, 잠깐 얘기좀 하지."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CYBORG_1.json
msgid "That's because I saved you.  Listen, I could use your help…"
msgstr "내가 널 구해줬으니까. 이봐, 나도 도움이 필요해..."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CYBORG_1.json
msgid ""
"Big fucking deal.  Do what I say or I'll shove that chip back where it "
"belongs."
msgstr "거래 몰라, 썅? 내 말대로 할래 아니면 그 칩 원래 있던 자리에 다시 박힐래?"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CYBORG_1.json
msgid "Sorry, I'm nobody.  Enjoy your freedom, I guess."
msgstr "미안, 난 그런 류의 사람이 아니라. 자유로워진 것이나 즐겨."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CYBORG_1.json
msgid "*buzz* Great! So what happens now?"
msgstr "*지직* 좋아! 이제 뭐 하면 돼?"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CYBORG_1.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/talk_cyborg_abomination.json
msgid "Come with me.  We can help each other out."
msgstr "같이 가자. 서로 도울 수 있을 거야."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CYBORG_1.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/talk_cyborg_abomination.json
msgid "We both go our separate ways.  Enjoy your freedom."
msgstr "여기서 갈라지자. 자유를 즐겨."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CYBORG_1.json
msgid ""
"...Wait. *BEEP* Why do I believe you? *ZZZT* You could be just as bad as "
"them!"
msgstr "...아니, *삐익* 너도 그 놈들이랑 *지지직* 한 패 아냐? 내가 널 어떻게 믿어?"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CYBORG_1.json
msgid ""
"I wouldn't have pulled your chip out if I didn't want you to think for "
"yourself."
msgstr "너 풀어줄려고 그 칩 뽑아줬는데 고맙단 소리도 못 하냐?"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CYBORG_1.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/talk_cyborg_abomination.json
msgid ""
"For all you know, I did.  I'm being nice for now.  You'd better hope that it"
" lasts."
msgstr "모를까봐 말하는 건데, 그거 내가 했어. 지금 예의를 지키려고 노력하는 중이니까 그 노력 끝나지 않기를 바라는 게 좋을 걸."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CYBORG_1.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/talk_cyborg_abomination.json
msgid "Forget it.  Enjoy your freedom."
msgstr "잊어버려. 자유를 즐기라고."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CYBORG_1.json
msgid ""
"Okay, okay, *BUZZ* I'm sorry! Don't hurt me again! Anything but the chip!"
msgstr "아니 알았어! 제발! 하라는 대로 할 테니까 그 칩은...!"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CYBORG_1.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/talk_cyborg_abomination.json
msgid "Follow me and do my bidding, then."
msgstr "이제야 좀 알아듣네. 따라와."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CYBORG_1.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/talk_cyborg_abomination.json
msgid "Get out of my sight."
msgstr "뒤지기 싫으면 꺼져."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CYBORG_1.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/talk_cyborg_abomination.json
msgid "No, *I'm* sorry, I didn't mean that.  Go do what you want."
msgstr "아니, *내가* 미안하다. 그럴려고 했던 게 아니다. 하고 싶은 대로 해라."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CYBORG_1.json
msgid "...kill… *ZTZTZT* …you!"
msgstr "널 ... *치치직* ...죽여버리겠다!"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CYBORG_1.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/talk_cyborg_abomination.json
msgid "Run while you still can!"
msgstr "죽기 싫으면 도망가라!"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CYBORG_1.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/talk_cyborg_abomination.json
msgid "Not if I kill you first!"
msgstr "널 먼저 죽이면 되지!"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CYBORG_1.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/talk_cyborg_abomination.json
msgid "I'm sorry!  I shouldn't have said that!"
msgstr "미안해! 그런 말 하면 안 되는 거였는데!"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CYBORG_1.json
msgid "Yeah, *beeeeep* I don't think so.  Bye."
msgstr "그래. *삐이이이이익* 나도 그렇게 생각 안 해. 잘 가."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CYBORG_1.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/talk_cyborg_abomination.json
msgid "Suit yourself."
msgstr "꺼져."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_FACTION_CAMP.json
msgid "What about faction camps?"
msgstr "세력 캠프는 어때?"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_FACTION_CAMP.json
msgid "Tell me how faction camps work."
msgstr "세력 캠프가 어떻게 돌아가는지 말해줘."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_FACTION_CAMP.json
msgid "Tell me how faction camps have changed."
msgstr "세력 캠프가 어떻게 변했는지 말해줘."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_FACTION_CAMP.json
msgid "I want you to build a camp here."
msgstr "여기에 임시 거처를 만들자."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_FACTION_CAMP.json
msgid "We need to abandon this camp."
msgstr "이 캠프를 버려야 해."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_FACTION_CAMP.json
msgid "Nothing.  Let's talk about something else."
msgstr "아무것도 아니야. 다른 이야기를 하자."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_FACTION_CAMP.json
msgid "Never mind, let's talk about other things you can do"
msgstr "됐어. 다른 얘기 하자."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_FACTION_CAMP.json
msgid "Nothing.  Lets' get back to work."
msgstr "아무것도 아니야. 다시 일하러 가자."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_FACTION_CAMP.json
msgid ""
"The faction camp system allows you to use friendly NPCs to take over "
"existing buildings or construct new buildings and use them to extend the "
"usefulness of your allies.  When you have a faction camp, you can order your"
" companions to perform missions, such as crafting new items, building up the"
" camp, hunting for food, or recruiting more allies.  Faction camps also "
"simplify some aspects of managing your companions."
msgstr ""
"세력 캠프 시스템은 네가 우호적인 NPC들을 활용해서 기존의 건물을 차지하거나, 새 건물을 지어서 네 동료들이 더 쓸모있어지게 만들 수 "
"있게 하지. 세력 캠프가 있으면 네 동료들에게 물건을 만들라거나, 캠프 내에 시설물을 지으라거나, 음식을 마련해오라거나, 아니면 새 "
"동료를 모아오라는 등의 임무를 내릴 수 있어. 그리고 네 동료를 관리하는 방식을 세력 캠프가 일정 부분 간소화시켜주기도 하고."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_FACTION_CAMP.json
msgid "Give me an overview of how camps work."
msgstr "세력 캠프가 어떻게 작동하는지 대략적으로 알려줘."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_FACTION_CAMP.json
msgid "Tell me more about faction camps and food."
msgstr "세력 캠프와 음식에 대해서 더 말해줘."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_FACTION_CAMP.json
msgid "Tell me more about camp missions."
msgstr "캠프 임무에 대해서 더 말해줘."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_FACTION_CAMP.json
msgid "Tell me about building a camp."
msgstr "캠프 건설에 대해서 말해줘."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_FACTION_CAMP.json
msgid "Give me some advice on building a camp."
msgstr "캠프 건설에 대해서 조언 좀 해줘."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_FACTION_CAMP.json
msgid "I know the basics.  Just tell me what changed."
msgstr "기본적인 건 알아. 뭐가 바뀌었는지만 알려줘."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_FACTION_CAMP.json
msgid "Never mind, let's go back to talking about camps."
msgstr "아무것도 아냐, 캠프 이야기로 돌아가자"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_FACTION_CAMP.json
msgid "Never mind, let's talk about other things you can do."
msgstr "됐어. 다른 얘기 하자."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_FACTION_CAMP.json
msgid "Never mind, let's talk about something else."
msgstr "아무것도 아냐, 다른 얘기 좀 하자."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_FACTION_CAMP.json
msgid "Forget it.  Let's go."
msgstr "잊어 버려. 가자."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_FACTION_CAMP.json
msgid ""
"Each faction camp starts with a bulletin board.  You can 'e'xamine the bulletin board to get a list of available missions with descriptions, and to assign an NPC to work on a mission.  The bulletin board is the primary way to access the camp.\n"
"  If both you and a companion have two-way radios, you can assign missions to the companion remotely by talking on the radio.\n"
"  When you ask a companion to start a camp, they'll build a bulletin board at the current location, and that will establish a faction camp at that overmap tile.  A faction camp has a central tile where the bulletin board is, and possibly one or more expansions that are in adjacent tiles.\n"
"  All of your faction camps can be stocked with food, and your companions will eat from that food when performing camp missions, or even when they're just hungry and near the camp.\n"
"  Currently, faction camps can be created in fields, in fire stations, and in some evac shelters."
msgstr ""
"모든 세력 캠프는 게시판에서 시작해. 게시판을 조사해서 지금 할 수 있는 임무와 자세한 설명을 확인하고, 또 NPC들을 임무에 배치하지. 캠프를 이용하는 수단 중 첫번째가 게시판이라고 봐도 돼.\n"
"  또, 너랑 동료가 둘 다 양방향 라디오를 갖고 있으면 라디오로 방송해서 멀리 떨어진 동료에게도 임무를 부여할 수 있지.\n"
"  동료에게 캠프를 새로 만들자고 이야기하면, 지금 있는 곳에 게시판을 만들어 오버맵 타일을 세력 캠프로 바꿀거야. 이 게시판이 있는 타일이 중심이 되어서 하나 내지는 그 이상의 여러 타일들로 주변을 감싸지.\n"
"  모든 세력 캠프는 음식을 쌓아둘 수 있고, 네 동료들이 캠프 임무 수행 중이거나, 배고플 때 캠프 근처에 있다면 알아서 가져다 먹을거야.\n"
"  현재는 평야, 소방서, 비상 대피소에 세력 캠프를 지을 수 있어."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_FACTION_CAMP.json
msgid "Wait, we can talk with radios?"
msgstr "잠깐, 라디오를 통해 대화할 수 있다고?"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_FACTION_CAMP.json
msgid ""
"Faction camps require food, but simplify managing your companions.\n"
"  When you activate a camp's bulletin board, you'll be required to make some zones if you haven't already.  One of those zones must be a camp food zone.  If you drop food in the camp food zone and select the 'Distribute Food' mission, then the food will disappear and be converted into stored kcalories.\n"
"  When you send companions out on camp missions, they'll eat from the stored food when they return at the rate of 2,500 kcalories per day.  Some missions have variable length, and companions will become upset if there isn't enough food when they come back, so try to keep a healthy surplus of food on hand.\n"
"  Companions who aren't on camp missions, but who are following you, will also eat from the camp food stores whenever they're hungry and within 2 overmap tiles of the camp.  This drastically simplifies keeping your followers fed, so it's worthwhile to build a minimal faction camp just for this feature.\n"
"  You can upgrade a camp to include a water well.  If you do, your followers will also drink from the well when they're thirsty."
msgstr ""
"세력 캠프를 운영하는데는 음식이 들지만, 동시에 네 동료들을 더 간편하게 관리할 수 있게 해줘.\n"
"  캠프의 게시판을 사용할 때, 어떤 영역들이 아직 없다면 반드시 만들어야 해. 그 중 하나는 캠프 음식 보관지야. 그 영역 안에 음식을 놔두고 \"식량 공급\" 임무를 선택하면, 음식이 사라지면서 저장된 칼로리로 변환되지.\n"
"  동료들을 캠프 외부 임무로 보내면, 그 친구들이 돌아올 때 하루당 2,500킬로칼로리 비율로 저장된 음식을 소비할거야. 임무마다 걸리는 시간이 다르고, 기껏 돌아왔는데 먹을 음식이 없으면 동료들이 열받을거야. 그러니 항상 여분의 음식을 준비해두라고.\n"
"  캠프 임무 수행 중이 아니고, 너랑 함께하고 있는 동료들도 배가 고프고 캠프랑 오버맵 2타일 이내에 있으면 캠프에 저장된 음식을 먹을거야. 이것만으로도 네 동료들이 굶어죽지 않게 유지하기 쉬워지니까, 이 기능만 쓰려고 세력 캠프를 짓는 것도 나쁘지 않아.\n"
"  캠프에 우물을 지을 수도 있어. 그렇게 하면 동료들이 목이 마르면 알아서 우물에서 물을 떠다 마시겠지."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_FACTION_CAMP.json
msgid ""
"When you assign an NPC to a faction camp mission, they'll disappear while they go do whatever you want them to do.  When the duration of the mission has elapsed, you'll see a new mission on the bulletin board to have them return and complete the mission by upgrading your camp, returning their hunting kills, dropping off whatever they were crafting, or whatever else the mission results are.\n"
"  There are all kinds of faction camp missions: building up the camp, recruiting new allies, hunting and trapping game, scrounging for materials, farming, disassembling cars, and more.  Not all activities can be done at every camp - you may need to build some additional buildings, or expand the camp, to get access to some missions.\n"
"  Some faction camp missions can be duplicated by companion activities, but building up the camp can only be done via faction camp missions.\n"
"  You assign missions by interacting with the bulletin board.  You'll see a list of available missions for your central camp tile.  If your camp has expansions, you can tab through the expansions to see the available missions at each expansion.\n"
"  Remember, companions on camp missions need to be fed, and will become angry if they complete a mission but there isn't any food in the larder.\n"
"  There is one special mission called 'Emergency Recall'.  You can use this to retrieve any companion on a faction camp mission, but this cancels the mission and wastes any resources used on it.  Only use it to recover allies when something has gone really wrong with your camp and you can't get them to come back any other way."
msgstr ""
"NPC를 세력 캠프 임무에 배치하면, 네가 시킨 일을 하러 잠시 사라질거야. 임무 기한이 종료되면 게시판에 그들을 귀환시켜 임무를 완수할 수 있게 하는 새 임무가 생기고, 캠프 발전, 전리품 회수, 제작품 획득, 뭐 그런 임무 결과를 얻을 수 있겠지.\n"
"  세력 임무는 다양해. 캠프 건설, 동료 모집, 사냥, 덫 놓기, 재료 회수, 농사, 차량 분해, 그밖에도 많아. 그렇지만 하나의 캠프에서 이걸 다 할 수는 없어. 어떤 건물을 지어야 가능한 임무라거나, 일정 넓이 이상의 캠프여야 가능한 임무 같은 것도 있을 수 있지.\n"
"  몇몇 세력 캠프 임무는 동료한테 시킬 수 있는 활동과 겹치지만, 캠프 구축은 세력 캠프 임무로만 가능해.\n"
"  게시판과 상호작용해서 임무를 배치할 수 있어. 캠프 중심부 타일에서 가능한 온갖 임무를 죄다 볼 수 있지. 확장지가 있다면 그 확장지에서 가능한 임무를 볼 수도 있고.\n"
"  기억해둬. 캠프 임무를 시킨 동료들은 잘 먹여야 해. 임무를 끝내고 돌아왔는데 식료품 저장고에 먹을게 없으면 화낼거야.\n"
"  \"긴급 소집\" 이라는 특별한 임무가 있어. 지금 세력 캠프 임무를 진행 중인 동료들을 죄다 돌아오게 시키는건데, 이렇게 하면 임무가 취소되고 소모한 자원은 날아가버려. 캠프에 진짜 큰일이 일어나서 저치들을 꼭 데려와야만 해결되는 상황에서만 쓰도록 해."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_FACTION_CAMP.json
msgid "What do you mean by angry?"
msgstr "화를 낸다는 게 무슨 소리야?"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_FACTION_CAMP.json
msgid ""
"Currently, there are three types of camps that you can start building: modular field camps, fire station camps, and evac shelter camps.  There used to be a fourth called the primitive field camp, but you can't start those anymore, only upgrade them.\n"
"  Modular field camps are the most flexible kind of camp since you can build them almost anywhere and can locate them to have plenty of space for expansions, but you start with nothing in a field and have to build every building, so they can require a lot of resources.  Fire station and evac shelter camps are faster to build since you start in an existing building, but you have to establish them in an existing building and there may not be any space for expansions.\n"
"  Each camp location will have a variety of upgrade missions for it.  The various missions have descriptions.  In general, though, you'll need to establish housing if you want to expand, and some missions such as hunting or recruiting will require that you have some kind of kitchen or office that you can use to help schedule activities."
msgstr ""
"지금 네가 지을 수 있는 캠프는 크게 세 종류야. 모듈식 평야 캠프, 소방서 캠프, 대피소 캠프. 예전에는 원시적 평야 캠프라는 네번째 캠프가 있었지만, 지금은 새로 지을 수 없고 이전에 지어둔걸 업그레이드하는 것만 가능해.\n"
"  모듈식 평야 캠프는 제일 유연한 형태의 캠프야. 거의 아무 곳에나 지을 수 있고, 더 넓은 곳으로 확장하기도 쉽지. 그렇지만 기반이 될만한게 없어서 필요한 건물을 전부 직접 지어야 하니, 자원이 장난 아니게 필요할거야. 반면에 소방서 캠프나 대피소 캠프는 이미 지어진 건물을 쓰면 되니까 구축이 빨라.\n"
"  캠프 위치마다 발전 임무가 여러 종류 있어. 각각 설명도 딸려있지. 그렇지만, 뭐, 보통 확장하고 싶으면 새 주거공간을 지어야 하고, 사냥이나 신입 모집 같은걸 하려면 부엌이나 사무실이 있어야 활동 계획을 짜기 편할거야."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_FACTION_CAMP.json
msgid "Tell me about modular field camps."
msgstr "모듈식 평야 캠프에 대해서 말해줘."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_FACTION_CAMP.json
msgid "Tell me about fire station camps."
msgstr "소방서 캠프에 대해서 말해줘."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_FACTION_CAMP.json
msgid "Tell me about evac shelter camps."
msgstr "비상 대피소 캠프에 대해서 말해줘."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_FACTION_CAMP.json
msgid "Tell me about expansions."
msgstr "캠프의 확장에 대해서 말해줘."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_FACTION_CAMP.json
msgid ""
"Modular field camps are the most flexible kind of camp, but they require a lot of time and resources to build.  You start with an empty field - and it has to be a real empty field, not a field on a ranch or farm - and build up from nothing.  You can build from wattle-and-dab if you're feeling primitive, wood panels if you have a lot of nails, metal plate if you're a welder, or tents if you're in a hurry.\n"
"  You start by building a lean-to and a bed in the northeast corner of the central camp, and then add a fire place, and expand out until you have a small shelter for two people.  When that is complete, you can expand the camp in a variety of ways:\n"
"  1.  You can build up to 5 more rooms or shacks, 3 on each side of the camp.\n"
"  2.  You can build a central building in the south half of the camp, between the rooms.  The central building will act as a command center, allowing your camp to perform hunting, recruiting, and combat patrol missions.\n"
"  3.  You can dig trenches on all sides of the camp, which can possibly connect to the rooms on the sides to minimize the amount of trenching you need to do.\n"
"  4.  You can build various small features such as root cellars to preserve food or a radio tower to make it easier to recruit more companions.\n"
"  Each new construction in a modular camp can be made from a different material, so you aren't constrained by what you start with.  Tents are fast to put up, but fragile and likely to get destroyed by zombies.  The central building has to be made from wattle-and-daub, wood, or metal, and requires more materials if the side rooms are made from tents."
msgstr ""
"모듈식 평야 캠프는 뭘 어떻게 지을지 네 자유가 크게 반영되지만, 그만큼 시간과 자원이 들어갈거야. 네 시작지점은 평야야. 농장이나 목장 같은게 있는 곳 말고 진짜로 아무 것도 없는 평야. 완전 야생적인 생활이 하고 싶으면 초벽을 지을수 있겠고, 못이 충분하면 나무벽, 용접기가 있으면 금속판, 다 필요없고 급해죽겠으면 텐트 하나로도 충분해.\n"
"  캠프 중심부의 북동쪽 구석에 조그만 건물이랑 침대를 만들고, 불피울만한 곳도 준비해둬. 그러고 나서 두 사람이 지낼만한 피난처가 될 때까지 확장하라고. 그게 끝나고 나면 그 다음부터 캠프를 어떤 식으로 넓힐지는 여러 방법이 있어.\n"
"  1. 방이나 헛간을 5개쯤 만들어. 캠프 한쪽 면에 3개씩 놓이게.\n"
"  2. 방들 사이, 캠프 남쪽 절반쯤 되는 곳에 중심이 될만한 건물을 만들어. 네 지휘부가 되어줄거고, 캠프에서 사냥을 떠나거나, 신입을 모집하거나, 전투 정찰을 준비할 수 있게 해주지.\n"
"  3. 캠프 사방에 참호를 파둬. 각 방들과 잘 연결하면 비교적 조금만 파도 될거야.\n"
"  4. 음식을 보관해둘 지하 저장실, 새 동료를 더 쉽게 모을 방송탑, 뭐 그런 작은 기능들을 추가해.\n"
"  모듈식 캠프에 새로 뭔가를 지을 때마다 서로 다른 재료로 해도 상관없어. 그러니 뭐부터 하든 네 자유야. 텐트는 만들기 쉽지만 허술해서 좀비들이 쉽게 박살내지. 그러니 네 바깥쪽 건물들이 텐트라면, 중심 건물은 초벽, 나무, 금속, 뭐 그런 재료들이 필요할거야."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_FACTION_CAMP.json
msgid "Got it.  Tell me about expansions."
msgstr "이해했어. 이제 캠프 확장에 대해서 설명해줘."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_FACTION_CAMP.json
msgid "Can we review how camps work?"
msgstr "캠프가 어떻게 작동하는지 다시 짚어볼 수 있을까?"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_FACTION_CAMP.json
msgid ""
"Fire stations make good basecamps.  You start with a brick building with secure metal doors, so you're not going to see your efforts destroyed by zombies.  On the downside, there may not be many fields around, so you may not be able to expand much.\n"
"  Fire station camps are also very compact.  There isn't much living space, but you can build a small pottery or blacksmithy, a chop shop in one of the garage bays, and even tear up some of the pavement to create a garden.  The existing kitchen makes it easy to cook from the start, though you may need to spruce it up a bit."
msgstr ""
"소방서는 기지를 짓기 아주 좋은 곳이지.  처음부터 벽돌로 된 건물, 안전한 강철문이 있으니 좀비들 걱정을 좀 덜 수 있을 거야.  하지만 주변에 공간이 많이 없기 때문에 확장성은 떨어지는 게 단점이야.\n"
" 소방서 캠프는 아주 밀집되어 있어.  주거 공간은 많지 않지만 작은 공방이나 대장간 또는 차고에 차량 개조 공간을 마련하거나 도로 부분을 뜯어내어 정원을 만들 수도 있을 거야.  기본적으로 있는 부엌 덕에 처음부터 요리를 할 수는 있지만 조금 다음어야 할 지도 모르겠어."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_FACTION_CAMP.json
msgid ""
"You can build a faction camp in the common evac shelter - the basic design with a single, wide open room.  Evac shelters are everywhere and often have fields surrounding them, so they're a little more flexible than a modular field camp but still make it easy to add expansions.\n"
"  Evac center camps can be built up in several ways.  You basically need to decide between building more bedrooms or adding for crafting and cooking space."
msgstr ""
"아무 비상 대피소에 세력 캠프를 구축할 수 있어. 가장 기본적인 넓고 탁 트인 공간이지. 비상 대피소는 어디든지 있고, 가끔은 평야 한가운데에 떡하니 자리잡고 있기도 해. 그러니 모듈형 캠프보다는 덜 유연할지 몰라도, 여전히 확장하기 쉽지.\n"
"  비상 대피소에 구축한 캠프에는 여러 방향성이 있어. 보통 거주공간을 더 만들지, 제작터와 주방을 더 만들지로 나뉘지."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_FACTION_CAMP.json
msgid ""
"Each camp can have up to 8 expansions, one in each adjacent overmap tile.  Expansions add to the capabilities of your camp, such as adding a farm field or a manufactory for crafting all kinds of things.\n"
"  You need two beds in a room in your central camp for each expansion, and currently, expansions can only be built in fields and have to be built up from scratch.\n"
"  Expansion missions show up in separate tabs in the bulletin board, one set of missions per location, and you'll need to hit 'tab' to see them.  The currently available expansions are:\n"
"  -- Farm: This is a full tile of plowed fields that you can maintain or send companions on missions to maintain.  Plants grow here normally.\n"
"  -- Garage: This is a large building.  Companions can be sent on missions here to disassemble vehicles.  Of course, you can also assign companions to disassemble vehicles without a garage, so this expansion is not very useful.\n"
"  -- Canteen: This is an expanded kitchen, dining area, and pantry.\n"
"  --Livestock Area: This is a modular set of buildings for holding livestock such as cows, horses, or chickens.  Animals are not included!\n"
"  Saltworks Area: This is a small expansion for processing salt.\n"
"  Fabrication Workshop: This is a large expansion for doing all kinds of crafts.  Companions can use some of the furniture in this expansion to craft some items much faster than you can do by yourself by hand.\n"
"  Central Storage Building: This is a large building for storing goods."
msgstr ""
"각각의 캠프는 인접한 오버맵 타일에 한 개씩, 총 8개의 확장을 건설할 수 있어.  확장을 하면 경작지를 추가하거나 여러가지 물품을 제작할 수 있는 공장 같은 것들을 추가해서 캠프의 기능을 향상시킬 수 있지.\n"
" 각각의 확장을 위해서는 중앙 캠프의 방에 두 개의 침대가 있어야 해.  또 현재로서는 확장은 아무것도 없는 평야에서 건설해야 하지.\n"
" 확장 임무는 게시판 별도의 탭에서 나타나고 각 장소 당 한 가지 종류의 임무가 나오니까 'tab'을 눌러 살펴봐야 할 거야.  현재 가능한 확장 목록은 다음과 같아.\n"
" -- 농장: 네가 직접 농사를 짓거나 임무를 통해 동료들을 보낼 수 있는 경작된 평야야.  식물들은 여기서 정상적으로 자라.\n"
" -- 차고: 거대한 건물이야.  동료들은 임무를 통해 이곳에서 자동차를 분해할 수 있어.  당연히, 차고 확장 없이도 자동차 분해 임무를 보낼 수 있으니 그렇게까지 유용한 확장은 아닌 거지.\n"
" -- 식당: 부엌의 연장선이야.  식사를 하거나 음식을 저장할 수 있지.\n"
" -- 가축 공간: 소나 말, 닭 같은 가축들을 기를 수 있는 모듈형 건물의 집합체야.  건물만 지을 뿐이지 동물들은 제공하지 않아!\n"
" 염전: 소금을 생산할 수 있는 작은 확장이지.\n"
" 작업장: 모든 종류의 제작을 할 수 있는 거대한 확장이야. 동료들은 이 확장에서의 가구들을 이용해서 네 손으로 직접 만드는 것보다 더 빠르게 물건들을 제작할 수 있어.\n"
" 중앙 저장소: 이건 물건들을 저장할 수 있는 커다란 건물이야."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_FACTION_CAMP.json
msgid "Got it.  Give me some advice on building a camp."
msgstr "알았어.  캠프를 건설하는 것에 대해 조언을 좀 해줘."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_FACTION_CAMP.json
msgid ""
"Starting a camp doesn't take much time, and you can use a faction camp to keep your companions fed without needing to regularly give them food, so it's a good idea to establish a minimal camp anywhere you intend to be for a while.\n"
"  How much you want to expand your camps is up to you.  A modular field camp can be very resource intensive, but building one up allows you to send companions off to hunt and farm for you, so there's quite the pay-off.  If nothing else, you should consider upgrading the northeast tent to the point where you can build a water well, or if you started with a fire station or evac shelter camp, you should build a water well as soon as you can.\n"
"  If you have access to a fire station or evac shelter, you may want to build your camp in them.  Both of those camps are are very compact, but have much of the same functionality as an upgraded field camp without requiring so many resources.\n"
"  If you are adding expansions to your camp, consider starting with a farm or fabrication workshop.  The farm makes it easy to grow your own food, while the fabrication workshop can allow you to craft some of the resources you need to upgrade your camp.\n"
"  The canteen, saltworks, livestock area, and storage area probably shouldn't be your first expansions, but they all have their uses."
msgstr ""
"캠프를 시작하는 건 그렇게 오래 걸리지 않아.  또 세력 캠프를 이용하면 동료들에게 정기적으로 직접 음식을 건내줘야하지 않아도 되니까 어느 곳이든 잠시 머무를 생각이 있다면 작은 캠프를 개설하는 것은 좋은 생각이 될 거야.\n"
" 얼마나 캠프를 확장할 지는 너한테 달려있어.  모듈형 평야 캠프는 매우 많은 자원이 들지만, 짓고 나면 동료들을 사냥이나 농사 짓는데 보낼 수 있으니 보상이 있는 셈이지.  다른 특별한 상황이 아니라면 북동쪽의 텐트를 업그레이드 해서 우물을 짓는 것을 고려해보는 게 좋을 거야.  소방서나 대피소 캠프에서 시작했을 때에도 우물을 가장 먼저 짓는 것이 좋지.\n"
" 소방서나 대피소를 발견했다면 그곳에 캠프를 짓고 싶을 거야.  두 캠프는 모두 작지만 많은 자원을 필요로 하지 않고도 업그레이드 된 평야 캠프의 기능들을 누릴 수 있지.\n"
" 캠프를 확장할 생각이라면 농장이나 작업장부터 짓는 것을 고려해봐.  농장은 식량들을 직접 기를 수 있고, 작업장은 캠프를 업그레이드 하는데 필요한 자원들을 제작할 수 있지.\n"
" 식당이나 염전, 가축 공간, 그리고 저장소 같은 것들은 필수적이진 않지만 쓸모는 있지."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_FACTION_CAMP.json
msgid ""
"\n"
"1.  Faction camps used to require a second NPC to act as overseer and camp manager, but that's been replaced by the bulletin board and two-way radio.\n"
"2.  It used to be impossible to upgrade faction camps if there was a vehicle, even a cart, on the same map.  You can now upgrade camps even if there is a vehicle on the map, as long as the upgrade doesn't change the area under the vehicle.\n"
"3.  Faction camps used to upgrade by completely redrawing the map.  Damage to the camp would be replaced when the camp was upgraded.  Now upgrades only change the actual area being upgraded, and you will have to repair damage to the camp yourself.\n"
"4.  There used to be a single path for upgrading the main camp.  Now, after you have completed the first tent, you will have many options for your next upgrade, and you can have different companions working on different upgrades of the main camp at the same time.\n"
"5.  Friendly NPCs who are near a camp will feed themselves from the camp's food stores, and if the camp has a well, they'll use it to quench their thirst.\n"
"6.  You can now set up faction camps in select buildings.  The list of available buildings is constantly growing, so you'll have to experiment."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"1.  세력 캠프는 원래 감독관과 캠프 관리자로 활동할 두 번째 NPC가 필요했지만, 이게 그 기능은 게시판과 양방향 라디오로 대체되었어.\n"
"2.  원래  같은 지도에 단순한 카트일지라도 차량이 있었다면 캠프를 업그레이드하는 건 불가능했었지.  하지만 이젠 차량 밑의 지역은 변경하지 않음으로써 차량이 있더라도 업그레이드가 가능해졌어.\n"
"3.  세력 캠프는 원래 지도를 새로 다시 그리는 방식으로 업그레이드가 가능했지.  손상을 입은 캠프는 업그레이드가 되면 고쳐지면서 말이야.  하지만 이제 업그레이드는 실제 업그레이드 되는 부분들만 변경하니까 캠프에 입은 피해는 직접 고쳐야해.\n"
"4.  원래 주 캠프를 업그레이드하는 건 한 가지 방식 밖에 없었지만, 이제는 먼저 첫 번째 텐트를 완성한 후, 다음 업그레이드에 대한 많은 선택지들을 볼 수 있을 거야.  또 각각의 동료들에게 주캠프에 대한 서로 다른 업그레이드 명령을 동시에 내릴 수 있게 되었어.\n"
"5.  캠프 주변에 있는 우호적인 NPC들은 그들의 허기를 캠프의 음식 저장고에서 채울 거야.  만약 캠프에 우물이 있다면 갈증도 채울 수 있어.\n"
"6.  이제 건물들을 선택해서 캠프를 건설할 수도 있어.  가능한 건물들은 계속해서 추가해가는 중이니까 실험을 해봐야 할 거야."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_FACTION_CAMP.json
msgid "Wait, let's go back over from the start."
msgstr "잠깐, 처음으로 다시 돌아가자."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_FACTION_CAMP.json
msgid "Thanks, let's go back to talking about camps."
msgstr "고마워.  다시 캠프에 대해서 말해보자."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_FACTION_CAMP.json
msgid ""
"Hey boss.  I was thinking, you don't really need me sitting in this tent and"
" not really contributing to the camp.  It's a cushy job, but I could do "
"more.  We could put up a bulletin board and you could write up what you want"
" done there.  What do you say?"
msgstr ""
"이봐 대장.  내가 생각을 해봤는데, 내가 여기 이렇게 텐트 안에 앉아 있을 필요도 없고 캠프에 도움도 안 되는 것 같아.  편한 일이긴"
" 하지만, 난 더 일할 수 있다고.  게시판을 세워서 그곳에 무슨 일을 했으면 하는 지 적는거야.  어때?"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_FACTION_CAMP.json
msgid "What needs to be done?"
msgstr "할 거 있어?"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_FACTION_CAMP.json
msgid "Yes, set up the bulletin board and then go back to normal duties."
msgstr "어, 게시판 세워놓고 나서 하던 거 해."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_FACTION_CAMP.json
msgid "<hallu_dont_camp>"
msgstr "<hallu_dont_camp>"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_FRIEND_CONVERSATION.json
msgid ""
"Are you sure?  This doesn't seem like a particularly safe place for small "
"talk..."
msgstr "확실해?  여기는 잡담하기엔 안전한 장소처럼 보이지는 않는데..."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_FRIEND_CONVERSATION.json
msgid "It's fine, we've got a moment."
msgstr "괜찮아, 잠시 정도는 시간이 있어."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_FRIEND_CONVERSATION.json
msgid "Good point, let's find a more appropriate place."
msgstr "좋은 지적이야, 더 적절한 장소를 찾아보자."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_FRIEND_CONVERSATION.json
msgid "You're right.  Forget I said anything, let's get moving."
msgstr "네 말이 맞다 내가 아무 말 안 한 거 잊어버려, 어서 움직이자."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_FRIEND_CONVERSATION.json
msgid "What did you want to talk about?"
msgstr "무슨 이야기를 하고 싶은거야?"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_FRIEND_CONVERSATION.json
msgid "Actually, never mind."
msgstr "사실, 신경 쓰지 마."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_MARLOSS_VOICE.json
msgid "Yes, friend?"
msgstr "왜 그래, 친구?"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_MARLOSS_VOICE.json
msgid "Your travels be fruitful, friend."
msgstr "네 여행이 풍요롭기를, 여행자여."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_MARLOSS_VOICE.json
msgid "May you find your peace, traveler."
msgstr "당신의 평화를 찾기를, 여행자여."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_MARLOSS_VOICE.json
msgid "We might have lost everything, but hope remains."
msgstr "우리가 모든 걸 잃었을지는 모르지만, 적어도 희망은 남아있잖아."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_MARLOSS_VOICE.json
msgid "May the earth flourish beneath our paths."
msgstr "우리가 가는 길마다 대지가 풍요롭기를."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_MARLOSS_VOICE.json
msgid "Unity of spirit, of mind, and body..."
msgstr "영혼과 정신, 육체의 합일..."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_MARLOSS_VOICE.json
msgid "Look for the bonds which define you, and act in accord."
msgstr "너희를 정의하는 연결을 찾아, 그대로 행하라."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_MARLOSS_VOICE.json
msgid ""
"I don't know what kind of heresy you are spreading, but I'm putting an end "
"to it!"
msgstr "네놈이 퍼뜨리고 있는 광신이 뭔지는 모르겠지만, 내가 끝장내주러 왔다!"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_MARLOSS_VOICE.json
msgid "This place is dangerous, what are you doing here?"
msgstr "이렇게 위험한 곳에서 뭘 하고 있는거야?"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_MARLOSS_VOICE.json data/json/npcs/godco/cook.json
#: data/json/npcs/godco/foodguard.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_broker.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_old_guard_doctor.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_scavenger_mercenary.json
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_MERC_1.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/cyrus_whately.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_generic_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/Fuji_Structures/npc/TALK_BUNKER_MERCHANT.json
msgid "Who are you?"
msgstr "당신은 누구지?"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_MARLOSS_VOICE.json
msgid ""
"Dangerous?  It may look different, but this land cares and provides for us."
"  We are celebrating with a feast, in fact.  Do you care to join us?"
msgstr "위험? 글쎄, 여긴 우리가 지내기 편안하고 풍족한 곳인걸. 사실 우린 축제를 만끽하고 있어. 너도 낄래?"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_MARLOSS_VOICE.json
msgid "Well, sure."
msgstr "뭐, 그럴까."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_MARLOSS_VOICE.json
msgid "I'd… rather not."
msgstr "나는… 별로."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_MARLOSS_VOICE.json
msgid "I'm sorry…  I have places to be."
msgstr "유감이지만… 가야 할 곳이 있어서."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_MARLOSS_VOICE.json
msgid ""
"I'm a priest or guide of a sort.  I sing the hymns along my companions so "
"that we may learn to live in unity, both with each other and with our ailing"
" world."
msgstr ""
"나는 사제나, 안내자 같은거야. 친구들과 함께 성가를 부르며 우리가 통합되어 살아가는 삶을, 우리들 각각과 우리의 병든 세상이 함께하는 "
"방법을 배우지."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_MARLOSS_VOICE.json
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_MERC_1.json
msgid "Alright."
msgstr "그래."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_MARLOSS_VOICE.json
msgid "Can I join you?"
msgstr "함께해도 될까?"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_MARLOSS_VOICE.json
msgid "Understood.  Can I join you?"
msgstr "이해했어. 같이 해도 될까?"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_MARLOSS_VOICE.json
msgid "Well, I gotta go."
msgstr "글쎄, 가야겠어."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_MARLOSS_VOICE.json
msgid "Oh, but you already have."
msgstr "오, 그렇지만 넌 이미 갖고 있네."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_MARLOSS_VOICE.json
msgid "Yes… yes I have."
msgstr "그래... 그래 갖고 있지."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_MARLOSS_VOICE.json
msgid "Join us then, eat from this meal with us."
msgstr "함께하자. 우리와 함께 이걸 먹자."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_MARLOSS_VOICE.json
msgid "[Take marloss berry] Thank you."
msgstr "[말로스 열매 받음] 고마워."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_MARLOSS_VOICE.json
msgid "I have changed my mind, thank you."
msgstr "고마워, 그렇지만 생각이 바뀌었어."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_MARLOSS_VOICE.json
msgid "I'm joining no stinking cult!  Take your berry and shove it!"
msgstr "구역질나는 사교도가 될까보냐! 그 열매 가져다 땅에 처묻어라!"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_NC_FARMER.json
msgid "Are you one of them?"
msgstr "너도 그들 중 하나인가?"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_NC_FARMER.json
msgid "One of who?"
msgstr "그들이라니 누구?"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_NC_FARMER.json
msgid ""
"My thoughts exactly.  We have a lot in common, we should travel together!"
msgstr "정확히 말하자면, 내 생각들. 우리는 공통점이 많은 것 같은데, 같이 여행하면 좋겠는걸!"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_NC_FARMER.json
msgid "A daring trader?  Yes.  Let's trade items."
msgstr "무역상이었나? 좋아, 물물교환을 좀 할까."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_NC_FARMER.json
msgid "I don't have time for this."
msgstr "그럴 시간 없어."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_NC_FARMER.json
msgid ""
"Hey, you're alive!  Me too.  Been a long while since I've had a "
"conversation.  Uh, with someone else.  Um."
msgstr "오, 너 살아있었네! 나도 그래. 대화를 해본게 참 오랜만이야. 음, 나 자신 말고 말이지. 음."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_NC_FARMER.json
msgid "It's not safe here anymore, you need to move on."
msgstr "여긴 더이상 안전하지 않아. 움직여야 해."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_NC_FARMER.json
msgid "How did you make it?"
msgstr "어떻게 했어?"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_NC_FARMER.json data/json/npcs/TALK_SURVIVOR_CHEF.json
msgid "What did you do before the Cataclysm?"
msgstr "대재앙 이전에는 뭘 하고 살았어?"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_NC_FARMER.json
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid "Have anything to trade?"
msgstr "거래할만한게 있나?"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_NC_FARMER.json
msgid ""
"I heard it's bad in the cities, back when the radio was still working.  Some"
" of those things came through here.  I want to stay out in the country if I "
"can stay safe."
msgstr ""
"라디오가 아직 작동 중일 때, 도시들 상황이 말이 아니라고 들었어. 그것들 중 몇몇이 여길 지나갔지. 안전할 수 있다면 기꺼이 이 "
"동네에서 떠나고 싶어."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_NC_FARMER.json
msgid ""
"One of the nice things about the country life is the troubles of the world "
"take a little longer to reach you, and some don't get you at all.  We didn't"
" see any dead the first day, but we heard all kinds of crazy things on the "
"news."
msgstr ""
"시골 생황의 장점 중 하나는 세상의 문제들이 네게 닿기까지 오래 걸린다는 거야.  일부는 닿지도 않겠지.  우린 첫 날에는 죽은 사람은 "
"보지도 못 했어, 하지만 뉴스에서는 온갖 미친 소식들이 들려왔지."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_NC_FARMER.json data/json/npcs/TALK_SURVIVOR_CHEF.json
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/hunter_2.json
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/rural_1.json
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/rural_2.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_migo_2.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_migo_3.json
msgid "What happened next?"
msgstr "그래서?"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_NC_FARMER.json
msgid ""
"Come a little closer, I don't want to make too much noise.  You smell much "
"nicer than what I'm used to.  Someone in trouble banged on the door that "
"night, she said she was desperate, she had a baby, her home had burned down "
"and her drugs were gone and there were monsters in the streets.  We figured "
"she was on drugs, but we couldn't turn them away so we gave them food and "
"let them stay in the barn."
msgstr ""
"조금 더 가까이 와, 너무 큰 소리를 내고 싶진 않거든.  너한테선 내가 익숙해지고 있던 냄새보다 좋은 냄새가 나는군.  그날 밤, "
"곤경에 처한 누군가가 문을 두드렸고, 그녀는 지금 자신이 절망적인 상황이라며, 그녀에겐 아기가 있고 자신의 집은 불타버렸고, 약은 "
"사라졌으며, 거리에는 괴물들이 가득하다고 말했지.  우리는 그녀가 약을 빤 줄 알았어, 하지만 아기와 그녀를 그대로 돌려보낼 수는 없어서"
" 음식을 주고 헛간에서 머무를 수 있게 해줬지."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_NC_FARMER.json
msgid "That's decent, was she all right?"
msgstr "친절하군, 그녀는 괜찮았어?"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_NC_FARMER.json
msgid ""
"She was not all right.  I don't know what happened, if she was already "
"turning or if something got in and got her, but she and the baby didn't make"
" it.  We lost some more people trying to figure that out, it was horrible."
msgstr ""
"전혀 괜찮지 않았어.  무슨 일이 벌어진 줄은 모르지만, 그녀와 아기는 이겨내지 못했어.  무슨 일이 있었는지 알아내기 까지 그런 식으로"
" 몇명을 더 떠나보내야 했고 너무 끔찍했지."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_NC_FARMER.json
msgid "Are you all right?"
msgstr "괜찮아?"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_NC_FARMER.json
msgid ""
"I'm a lot better now, I've been hunkering down here.  Something came by in "
"the night screaming and crying, sounded just like that woman.  Maybe a "
"ghost, I don't know.  It's good to have company again.  You're not a ghost, "
"right?  On second thought, don't tell me if you are, I probably don't want "
"to know."
msgstr ""
"지금은 훨씬 나아, 난 여기 계속 숨어 있었어.  밤마다 무언가가 비명을 지르면서 울부짖으며 찾아왔었어.  그 여자처럼 말이야.  "
"유령이었을 지도 모르지.  다시 동료가 생기다니 다행이야.  넌 유령이 아니잖아, 그렇지?  다시 생각해보니, 진짜로 유령이라고 해도 "
"나한텐 말하지마, 알고 싶지 않으니까."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_NC_FARMER.json
msgid ""
"I grew up on the farm, I don't know much about ghosts and goblins,  but I've"
" spent a lot of time growing food and I work hard.  It's better in the "
"country, cleaner.  Not as dangerous.  I hope."
msgstr ""
"난 농장에서 자랐어.  유령이나 도깨비에 대해서는 많이 알지 못하지.  하지만 많은 시간을 음식을 기르면서 열심히 일했지.  시골에서의 "
"삶이 더 좋아, 깨끗하지.  그렇게 위험하지도 않아, 그러길 바라는 중이지."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_SURVIVOR_CHEF.json
msgid "Hey, I didn't expect to live long enough to see another living human!"
msgstr "살아있는 다른 사람을 만날 정도로 오래 살아남을 거라고 생각하지는 못했는데 말이야!"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_SURVIVOR_CHEF.json
msgid "I've been here since shit went down.  Just my luck I had to work."
msgstr "그 지경이 된 이후로 난 여기서 지내왔어.  그 날 일을 해야만 했다니 운이 좋았지."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_SURVIVOR_CHEF.json
msgid "How are you alive?"
msgstr "어떻게 살아있지?"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_SURVIVOR_CHEF.json
msgid ""
"Well, the dishwasher made a break for it three days after things got weird."
"  He was ripped to shreds before he made it to the street.  I figure this "
"place has gotta be safer than my apartment, and at least I've got all this "
"food here."
msgstr ""
"그, 어... 일이 터지고 나서 사흘 째 날에 설거지 알바가 혼자 탈출 시도를 했는데, 밖에 나가지도 못하고 좀비 밥이 되더라. 최소한 "
"여기가 내 아파트보단 안전할 거 같아서, 남은 음식 먹으면서 버티고 있었지."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_SURVIVOR_CHEF.json
msgid ""
"I… um… hid.  I was in the kitchen, preparing another masterpiece when I "
"heard glass shattering followed by screaming.  I ran over to the serving "
"window to see what happened, assuming a guest had fallen and broke "
"something.  What I witnessed was the most awful thing I've ever seen.  I'm "
"not even sure I could go over it again."
msgstr ""
"난... 어... 숨어있었어.  난 주방에서 또다른 역작을 만들고 있었을 때 유리가 깨지는 소리가 들리고 비명이 뒤따랐지.  무슨 일이 "
"벌어지고 있는지 살펴보려고 음식을 내놓는 곳으로 달려갔지, 난 손님이 뭔가를 떨어뜨린 줄 알았었어.  하지만 내가 목격했던 건 내가 본 "
"것 중 가장 끔찍한 광경이었지.  다시 쳐다볼 수 있을 거라는 생각조차 들지 않아."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_SURVIVOR_CHEF.json
msgid ""
"Some lunatic covered in a film of goo, black as oil, had fallen through one "
"of the large glass windows.  There were glass shards stuck in its head and "
"neck.  I thought the poor guy, girl-thing-whatever was dead.  People began "
"to crowd around it, some were taking pictures."
msgstr ""
"무슨 새까만 기름 같은 걸 떡칠한 사람이 가게 앞에 유리 벽에 머리를 박고 엎어져 있더라. 온 몸에 유릿조각이 박혀 있길래 죽은 줄 "
"알았지. 손님들은 사진 찍기 바빴고."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_SURVIVOR_CHEF.json
msgid "Horrible.  Did you get any pictures yourself?"
msgstr "끔찍하군.  사진이라도 찍어놨어?"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_SURVIVOR_CHEF.json
msgid ""
"No!  I figured the thing dead until it started writhing and spazzing out for"
" a moment.  Everyone jumped back, a few screamed, and one curious stranger "
"stepped in closer, kneeling a little… it attacked him!"
msgstr ""
"아니!  몸을 비틀면서 꿈틀대기 전까지는 완전히 죽은 줄만 알고 있었어.  모두가 깜짝 놀라서 물러섰고 몇몇은 비명을 질렀지.  그리고 "
"한 호기심 많은 사람이 무릎을 꿇으면서 가까이 다가가자... 그것이 그를 공격했어!"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_SURVIVOR_CHEF.json
msgid "What'd you do?"
msgstr "그래서? 어떻게 했는데?"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_SURVIVOR_CHEF.json
msgid ""
"I ran to the back of the kitchen and hid as best I could.  People outside "
"were screaming and I could hear them running.  Suddenly I heard more glass "
"shatter and something skitter out of the restaurant.  I waited a moment and "
"then went and checked the dining area.  Both the stranger and the thing were"
" gone.  People were running in the streets, some even had guns so I locked "
"all the doors and blocked the windows with what I could and barricaded "
"myself in here."
msgstr ""
"그래서 주방 뒤로 가서 숨었지. 온통 비명을 지르고 난장판이 펼쳐지는데, 좀 기다렸더니 유리 깨지는 소리가 더 들리길래 밖에 가서 봤더니"
" 그... 그거랑 물린 손님 둘 다 나가고 없더라. 밖에 사람들이 총 들고 뛰어다니길래, 가게 문 잠그고 창문 다 막아놓고 여기 "
"숨어있었어."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_SURVIVOR_CHEF.json
msgid "Crazy, so you have been here ever since?"
msgstr "큰일 날 뻔 했네. 그래서 쭉 여기 있었어?"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_SURVIVOR_CHEF.json
msgid ""
"Yeah, it was awhile before it was quiet again.  I heard all kinds of sounds:"
" explosions, jets flying by, helicopters, screaming, and rapid gunfire.  I "
"swear I even heard what sounded like a freaking tank drive by at one time!  "
"I've been hiding here since."
msgstr ""
"어, 며칠 있으니까 좀 조용해지더라. 밖이 전쟁터도 아니고 무슨 온갖 총 쏘고 터지는 소리랑 제트기랑 탱크랑 별 게 다 들리길래 쫄아서 "
"나가지도 못했지. 그래서 여기 계속 숨어 있었어."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_SURVIVOR_CHEF.json
msgid ""
"I've been a cook since forever, this wasn't the best joint, but management "
"was cool."
msgstr "평생 요리사 일 하고 살았어. 여기가 좀 시급이 별로긴 한데, 주인 양반이 사람이 되게 좋더라."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "Greetings friend, it's nice to see you."
msgstr "안녕 친구야, 만나서 반가워."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "So you're back… Explain yourself!"
msgstr "돌아왔구나... 정체를 밝혀라!"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "What sorcery is this?"
msgstr "이건 또 무슨 마법이야?"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "Welcome home Foodkid!"
msgstr "집에 돌아온 것을 환영해, 푸드키드!"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "Still here?  Take your time, it's rough out there."
msgstr "아직도 있니? 천천히 하렴. 바깥은 위험하단다."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "Greeting citizen, what brings you to the FoodLair?"
msgstr "시민 여러분, 안녕! 푸드레어에는 어쩐 일로 온 거야?"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "Greetings…  Foodperson?"
msgstr "안녕하세... 푸드퍼슨?"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "I am you but from an alternate reality."
msgstr "난 너야. 평행세계에서 왔지."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "I am Foodperson, who are YOU?"
msgstr "난 푸드퍼슨이야. 넌 대체 누구야?"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "There is only one real Foodperson!"
msgstr "진짜 푸드퍼슨은 딱 한 명 밖에 존재하지 않는다고!"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "I am the REAL Foodperson!"
msgstr "내가 진짜 푸드퍼슨이다!"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "Nevermind me, I'm just going to leave."
msgstr "신경쓰지마. 난 갈거야."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "Indeed it is I! The one and only FOODPERSON!"
msgstr "과연 나다! 세상에서 하나뿐인 푸드퍼슨!"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "Wow!  Such an honor to meet you in person!"
msgstr "와! 푸드퍼슨! 직접 만날 수 있어서 영광이야!"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "Are you joking?  Foodperson is not real, it's a restaurant mascot!"
msgstr "지금 장난치는 거냐? 푸드퍼슨은 실존하는 게 아니라 그냥 레스토랑 마스코트잖아!"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid ""
"The great Foodperson in the flesh!  Such an honor to finally meet you in "
"person!"
msgstr "여기 '살아있는' 진짜 푸드퍼슨이다! 드디어 만날 수 있어서 감격이야!"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "Ah…  Well, nice to meet you Foodperson."
msgstr "아... 그래. 만나서 반갑군, 푸드퍼슨."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "Do not mock me, for my strength is quite real!  Get out of here now!"
msgstr "날 모욕하지 마라. 내 힘은 '진짜'니까! 당장 여기서 나가!"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "Sheesh, ok, calm down, I'm leaving!"
msgstr "히익, 진정해! 간다고, 간다니까!"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "Forgive me, I didn't mean to disrespect you."
msgstr "용서해줘. 난 결례를 범하려 했던 게 아니야."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "Oh yeah?  Show me what you can do!"
msgstr "아 그래? 그럼 너가 뭘 할 수 있는지 대봐!"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "A common mistake, but I can assure you that I'm very real!"
msgstr "그럴 수도 있지. 하지만 내가 진짜라는 걸 너에게 확신시켜줄 수 있다구!"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "Sure, whatever."
msgstr "뭐, 좋아."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "Ok…  I believe you."
msgstr "그래... 믿어줄게."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "Anyway, do you need something?"
msgstr "아무튼, 뭐 필요한 거라도 있어?"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "Are you interested in some trading?"
msgstr "거래라도 할래?"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "Let's trade?"
msgstr "거래 할까?"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "I'm looking for a place to stay."
msgstr "지낼만한 장소가 필요해."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "I want to get stronger.  Please teach me."
msgstr "강해지고 싶어. 날 가르쳐 줘."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "Please share your knowledge."
msgstr "너의 지식을 나눠줘."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "I'm building up a team, people with special abilities."
msgstr "난 특별한 능력을 가진 사람들을 모아 팀을 만들고 있어."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "Can you tell me again about this sidekick offer?"
msgstr "사이드킥이 되라는 제안에 대해 다시 이야기 해줄 수 있겠어?"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "Alright, I thought about this, what do you say about we team up?"
msgstr "그래, 생각을 좀 해봤어. 같이 다니자는 거에 대해 어떻게 생각해?"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "I'm good, bye."
msgstr "난 괜찮아. 안녕."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "I already have everything I need here in the FoodLair!"
msgstr "푸드레어에 이미 필요한 모든 게 있잖아!"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "Alright let's see what you've got."
msgstr "좋아, 너가 뭘 가지고 있는지 보자구."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "You're not ready for this."
msgstr "너는 아직 준비가 안 됐다!"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "But I am worthy!"
msgstr "그치만... 이렇지 않으면... 푸드퍼슨... 내게 관심도 없는걸!"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "I can teach you a few tricks."
msgstr "내가 몇 가지 잔기술을 가르쳐 줄 수 있어."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "This is no place for a civilian.  You should go to the refugee center."
msgstr "시민들을 위한 곳은 없다구. 피난민 센터로 가줬으면 해."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "Damn!"
msgstr "야발!"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "Well…  You seem like a decent sort, I might have an offer for you."
msgstr "흠... 당신은 괜찮은 사람 같군. 한 가지 제안을 할 수 있겠어."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "Sorry but I work alone."
msgstr "미안, 난 혼자서 일 한다."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "We could really use your help!"
msgstr "도와줘, 푸드퍼슨!"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "What about: you prove your worth and join me as my sidekick?"
msgstr "그럼 이건 어때. 너가 뭘 할 수 있는 지를 증명하고 내 사이드킥으로서 함께 다니는 거야!"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "That sounds great!"
msgstr "좋은 생각이야!"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "Ok…"
msgstr "그래..."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "I need to think about it."
msgstr "생각 좀 해보고."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "Huh…  No thanks."
msgstr "허어... 필요 없어."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "There's other things I'd like to discuss."
msgstr "같이 얘기해볼 게 있는데..."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "Alright bye."
msgstr "그럼 안녕."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "The way you talk, the way you move…  You're…  You're me?  But how?"
msgstr "말하는 방식... 행동하는 방식... 넌... 넌 나잖아? 어떻게?"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid ""
"I…  I don't know.  It probably has something to do with <the_cataclysm>!  "
"What do you say we team up to find out?"
msgstr "나... 나도 잘 모르겠어. <the_cataclysm>때문인 것 같아! 함께 다니면서 원인이 뭔지 찾아보는 건 어때?"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid ""
"It might have something to do with <the_cataclysm>, mind if I stay here "
"while we try to figure this out?"
msgstr "<the_cataclysm>(이)랑 관련된 일이라고 생각해. 그.. 이거에 대해 좀 생각할 동안만 같이 좀 지내도 될까?"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "This can't be true, you're trying to trick me!"
msgstr "동작 그만. 밑장빼기냐?"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "I need time to think."
msgstr "잠깐 생각할 시간을 줘."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "Wha…  But.  But…  How?"
msgstr "엥... 에엥? 근데 어떻게?"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid ""
"No time to explain, the world is at an end and we must join forces to save "
"it!"
msgstr "설명할 시간이 없어. 세상은 대충 망했고 우린 힘을 합쳐 세상을 구해야 해!"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid ""
"The Cataclysm weakened the space-time continuum, I accidentally fell through"
" a tear in reality and ended up here.  I will need access to your resources "
"to keep fighting."
msgstr ""
"대격변은 시공의 연속성을 약화시켰고, 나는 찢겨진 현실의 구멍에 떨어져 여기까지 오게 되었어. 계속해서 싸우려면 네 도움이 필요해."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid ""
"I am the ultimate Foodperson, I travel the multiverse consuming powers from "
"all the Foodpersons.  And now I've come for you!"
msgstr "나는 궁극의 푸드퍼슨. 모든 푸드퍼슨들의 힘을 필요로 하는 다중우주를 여행하고있지. 그리고 여기에, 내가 왔다!"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "Can't tell you now.  In due time all will be revealed."
msgstr "지금은 말할 수 없어. 언젠간 모두 밝혀지게 될 거야."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "Of course, whatever you need…  Foodperson."
msgstr "필요한 건 다 있어... 푸드퍼슨."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "Thank you Foodperson!  It's good to know I have a friend here."
msgstr "고마워 푸드퍼슨! 이제 나도 친구가 생겼구나."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid ""
"It's crazy out there, it's going to be a tough journey but I'm with you!"
msgstr "바깥은 완전 개판이야. 힘든 여정이 되겠지만, 죽든 살든 난 너와 함께한다!"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "Let's go, we have a world to save!"
msgstr "가자, 세상을 구하러!"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "There can be only one!"
msgstr "푸드퍼슨은 단 한 명 뿐이다!"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "I AM THE ONE!"
msgstr "나를 누구라고 생각하느냐!!!"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "Wow calm down, it's just a prank bro."
msgstr "으아! 장난이야, 장난!"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "WAIT!  There might be another way!"
msgstr "기다려! 다른 방법이 있을 거야!"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "I don't want to fight you.  I'm leaving."
msgstr "너랑 싸우기 싫어. 난 갈래."

#: data/json/npcs/classes.json
msgid "No class"
msgstr "무직"

#: data/json/npcs/classes.json
msgid "I'm just wandering."
msgstr "그냥 궁금해서."

