#: data/json/recipes/basecamps/recipe_modular_field_defenses.json
msgid "east trench"
msgstr "동쪽 참호"

#: data/json/recipes/basecamps/recipe_modular_field_defenses.json
msgid ""
"Digging a trench along the west edge of the camp would provide some defense "
"and generate building materials.  We'll need to run the trench the length of"
