#: data/json/recipes/basecamps/recipe_modular_field_defenses.json
msgid "west trench"
msgstr "서쪽 참호"

#: data/json/recipes/basecamps/recipe_modular_field_metal.json
msgid ""
"We need some shelter, so build half of a metal shack with a metal roof on "
"the northeast side of the camp"
msgstr "은신처가 필요하니, 캠프 북동쪽에 금속 지붕이 달린 금속 헛간을 반쯤 지읍시다."

#: data/json/recipes/basecamps/recipe_modular_field_metal.json
#: data/json/recipes/basecamps/recipe_modular_field_migo_resin.json
#: data/json/recipes/basecamps/recipe_modular_field_rammed_earth.json
#: data/json/recipes/basecamps/recipe_modular_field_wad.json
#: data/json/recipes/basecamps/recipe_modular_field_wood.json
msgid "northeast shack"
msgstr "북동쪽 헛간"

#: data/json/recipes/basecamps/recipe_modular_field_metal.json
msgid ""
"We should use metal to expand the shelter so we have space for another bed."
msgstr "금속을 써서 은신처를 확장하면 더 많은 침대를 놓을 공간이 생길겁니다."

#: data/json/recipes/basecamps/recipe_modular_field_metal.json
#: data/json/recipes/basecamps/recipe_modular_field_migo_resin.json
#: data/json/recipes/basecamps/recipe_modular_field_rammed_earth.json
#: data/json/recipes/basecamps/recipe_modular_field_wad.json
#: data/json/recipes/basecamps/recipe_modular_field_wood.json
msgid "expand northeast shack"
msgstr "북동쪽 헛간 확장"

#: data/json/recipes/basecamps/recipe_modular_field_metal.json
msgid "We should use metal to finish the northeast shack."
msgstr "북동쪽 헛간을 마무리하려면 금속이 더 필요합니다."

#: data/json/recipes/basecamps/recipe_modular_field_metal.json
#: data/json/recipes/basecamps/recipe_modular_field_migo_resin.json
#: data/json/recipes/basecamps/recipe_modular_field_rammed_earth.json
#: data/json/recipes/basecamps/recipe_modular_field_wad.json
#: data/json/recipes/basecamps/recipe_modular_field_wood.json
msgid "finish northeast shack"
msgstr "북동쪽 헛간 마무리"

#: data/json/recipes/basecamps/recipe_modular_field_metal.json
msgid ""
"We should expand our housing by putting up a metal building on the east "
"side, which we can also use as part of the central building."
msgstr "동쪽에 금속 빌딩을 건축해 거주지를 넓혀야 합니다. 중앙 빌딩의 일부로 쓸 수도 있을테구요."

#: data/json/recipes/basecamps/recipe_modular_field_metal.json
#: data/json/recipes/basecamps/recipe_modular_field_migo_resin.json
#: data/json/recipes/basecamps/recipe_modular_field_rammed_earth.json
#: data/json/recipes/basecamps/recipe_modular_field_wad.json
#: data/json/recipes/basecamps/recipe_modular_field_wood.json
msgid "east shack"
msgstr "동쪽 헛간"

#: data/json/recipes/basecamps/recipe_modular_field_metal.json
msgid ""
"We should expand our housing by adding a metal room on the east side, which "
"we can also use as part of the central building."
msgstr "동쪽에 금속 방을 건축해 거주지를 넓혀야 합니다. 중앙 빌딩의 일부로 쓸 수도 있을테구요."

#: data/json/recipes/basecamps/recipe_modular_field_metal.json
#: data/json/recipes/basecamps/recipe_modular_field_migo_resin.json
#: data/json/recipes/basecamps/recipe_modular_field_rammed_earth.json
#: data/json/recipes/basecamps/recipe_modular_field_wad.json
#: data/json/recipes/basecamps/recipe_modular_field_wood.json
msgid "east room"
msgstr "동쪽 방"

#: data/json/recipes/basecamps/recipe_modular_field_metal.json
msgid ""
