msgstr "레일 바퀴 (조종 가능)"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'pair of small rail wheels'}
#: data/json/vehicleparts/wheel.json
msgid ""
"A pair of small rail wheels.  It performs well when riding on a pair of "
"small rails.  It performs terribly when not on a rail.  Moreover, you can't "
"steer it."
