#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/new_order/neworder_highorder.json
msgid "emissary"
msgid_plural "emissaries"
msgstr[0] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'emissary', 'str_pl': 'emissaries'}
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/new_order/neworder_highorder.json
msgid ""
"A towering, metallic creature with a stunningly beautiful design and "
"brilliantly shining etchings, standing atop three segmented legs.  The "
"tentacles that drift off of its central chassis are tipped with strange "
"looking devices as it strides slowly across the shatterd landscape.  This "
"one seems less aggressive than those seen on the frontlines of the Arrival, "
"studying its surroundings and probing things in the environment with a "
"variety of internal tools.  A sickeningly sweet gas hangs around it."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/new_order/neworder_highorder.json
msgid "The emissary emits a stream of sedative gas!"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/new_order/neworder_highorder.json
msgid "emissary of pestilence"
msgid_plural "emissaries of pestilence"
msgstr[0] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'emissary of pestilence', 'str_pl': 'emissaries
#. of pestilence'}
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/new_order/neworder_highorder.json
msgid ""
"A towering, stories-tall metallic creature standing atop three long legs "
"connected to a central chassis.  It would be stunningly beautiful with its "
"glowing golden inlays and celestial design, were it not for the gas that "
"pours from its tentacle-mounted guns that despoils the landscape and makes "
"your skin prickle just looking at its toxic, likely radioactive, glory.  Its"
" hums hauntingly as it moves and booming footsteps often heralded trouble to"
" come during the Arrival, now is no different."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/new_order/neworder_highorder.json
msgid "Putrid gas rolls across the landscape!"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/new_order/neworder_highorder.json
msgid "emissary of flame"
msgid_plural "emissaries of flame"
msgstr[0] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'emissary of flame', 'str_pl': 'emissaries of
#. flame'}
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/new_order/neworder_highorder.json
msgid ""
"Like all emissaries, this breathtaking metallic creature stands atop three "
"long legs, with many more segmented tentacles eminating from its central "
"chassis and a glowing halo about its head.  This one is far more terrifying "
"though, its claim to fame being some sort of high-intensity energy cannon, "
"capable of rending whatever it touches asunder in an explosive burst of "
"plasma and flame.  Its unique chirping and booming footsteps often heralded "
"trouble to come during the Arrival, and now is no different."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/new_order/neworder_highorder.json
msgid "Sound returns as the emissary's cannon roars to life!!"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/new_order/neworder_loworder.json
msgid "order surveillance drone"
msgid_plural "order surveillance drones"
msgstr[0] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'order surveillance drone'}
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/new_order/neworder_loworder.json
msgid ""
"A small, sleek, white-plated robot with the golden insignia of the Order "
"stamped on it.  Capable of limited flight, it hovers about the ruins of the "
"former world, onboard cameras and spotlights impartial witness to the chaos "
"around it.  Who knows might be watching on the other side…"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/new_order/neworder_loworder.json
msgid "order seeker drone"
msgid_plural "order seeker drones"
msgstr[0] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'order seeker drone'}
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/new_order/neworder_loworder.json
msgid ""
"A small, sleek, white-plated robot with the golden insignia of the Order "
"stamped on it.  Capable of limited flight, it hovers about the ruins of the "
"former world, using a suite of rather sharp looking retractable tools, a "
"bright camera flash, and integrated 'arms' to manipulate the world around it"
" with surprising dexterity and procure samples.  It seems to watch you "
"closely…"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Attack message of monster "{'str': 'order seeker drone'}"'s spell "None"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/new_order/neworder_loworder.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s blinds %3$s with its integrated camera!"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/wild_aliens/alien_fauna.json
msgid "sewer lurker"
msgid_plural "sewer lurkers"
msgstr[0] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'sewer lurker'}
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/wild_aliens/alien_fauna.json
msgid ""
"A dripping creature, a writhing mass of tentacles attached to a gnashing "
"maw, this thing seems to have found its home among trash and sewage.  It is "
"an ambush predator, prefering to lurk just beneath the cloudy water before "
"something comes close enough to snag with its long tentacles."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/wild_aliens/alien_fauna.json
msgid "lurker"
msgid_plural "lurkers"
msgstr[0] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'lurker'}
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/wild_aliens/alien_fauna.json
msgid ""
"A long, serpentine body, dark and murky just like the waters it inhabits.  "
"Tendrils trail behind it, vestigial now given the innumerable teeth gnashing"
" in its mouth.  It prefers to lurk just below the surface, drifting and "
"still like an unassuming piece of floatsam until something gets too close."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/wild_aliens/alien_fauna.json
msgid "moss lizard"
msgid_plural "moss lizards"
msgstr[0] ""

#. ~ Description for moss lizard
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/wild_aliens/alien_fauna.json
msgid ""
"A cow-sized reptoid, covered in what appears to be a thick layer of mossy "
"vegetation and rocks.  It trudges about the landscape on sturdy legs, "
"foraging whatever flora it can reach with sharp little teeth.  It doesn't "
"seem to mind you too much."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/wild_aliens/alien_fauna.json
msgid "pack lizard"
msgid_plural "pack lizards"
msgstr[0] ""

#. ~ Description for pack lizard
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/wild_aliens/alien_fauna.json
msgid ""
"A slim reptoid about the size of a big dog, with a thick mane of what looks "
"like rather pretty orange-blue 'feathers' around its head.  Frond-like "
"protrustions grow from the top of its head down to the base of its tail, "
"glowing faintly when in the presence of other members of its pack."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/wild_aliens/alien_fauna.json
msgid "wisp"
msgid_plural "wisp"
msgstr[0] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'wisp'}
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/wild_aliens/alien_fauna.json
msgid ""
"A small, fist sized critter that looks like a floating slug with "
"bioluminescent markings, capable of limited flight through utilization of "
"membrenous, winglike protrustions and the secretion of a faint white mist.  "
"It is most commonly found around zipping around flowers, fruits, and other "
"sugary substances in small, communal groups.  It regards you with curiosity,"
" occasionally flashing its markings at you as if trying to communicate."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/wild_aliens/alien_fauna.json
msgid "bileworm"
msgid_plural "bileworms"
msgstr[0] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'bileworm'}
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/wild_aliens/alien_fauna.json
msgid ""
"A huge creature that smells like death, befitting its preferred diet of "
"carrion and other rotting organic material, though it may attack live prey "
"if it is hungry.  Its favorite tactic is dissolving its food with its highly"
" acidic vomit, and then consuming the resulting liquified remains.  It is "
"capable of both burrowing and limited land travel, with the help of a "
"multitude of stocky appendages that surround its mouth."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/wild_aliens/strays.json
msgid "stray"
msgid_plural "strays"
msgstr[0] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'stray'}
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/wild_aliens/strays.json
msgid ""
"A mutated human, a hateful shadow of their former self.  Patches of cyan-"
"purple crystals grow out of their pale flesh, slowly overtaking it."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/wild_aliens/strays.json
msgid "stray rockfeeder"
msgid_plural "stray rockfeeders"
msgstr[0] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'stray rockfeeder'}
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/wild_aliens/strays.json
msgid ""
"A swollen and mishappen body pierced from the inside by growths of rocks, "
"the lower half of its face nothing a distended jaw full of gnashing, "
"crystalline teeth.  It lets out bloodcurdling howls of pain and constantly "
"drips a foul smelling slurry of rocky sludge and bile."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/wild_aliens/strays.json
msgid "stray crystaltender"
msgid_plural "stray crystaltenders"
msgstr[0] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'stray crystaltender'}
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/wild_aliens/strays.json
msgid ""
"Little more than a moving mound of crystal and meat that occasionally spits "
"up a tide of glowing, rocky gruel from its many cracks and crevices, this "
"creature trudges to and fro, bearing a heavy burden.  From just behind the "
"murky surfaces of its shell, you can almost make out small, moving creatures"
" skittering about in its complex innards.  It seems only a matter of time "
"before its bulk grows too heavy for it and it collapses, becoming just "
"another part of this ever-alien world."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/wild_aliens/strays.json
msgid "stray prowler"
msgid_plural "stray prowlers"
msgstr[0] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'stray prowler'}
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/wild_aliens/strays.json
msgid ""
"This once-shambling mutant now moves with feral cunning, mouth menacing with"
" tusks of polished stone and fingers tipped with crystal-fused claws."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/wild_aliens/strays.json
msgid "stray predator"
msgid_plural "stray predators"
msgstr[0] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'stray predator'}
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/wild_aliens/strays.json
msgid ""
"Lithe muscle and pulasting crystal fused together, this creature crawls on "
"four, grossly enlongated limbs sharpened to deadly points, spearing "
"intruders to its domain.  Though it moves quickly, it seems only a matter of"
" time before the very shell that protects it weighs it down to the ground."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/wild_aliens/strays.json
msgid "stray bruiser"
msgid_plural "stray bruisers"
msgstr[0] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'stray bruiser'}
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/wild_aliens/strays.json
msgid ""
"Standing much steadier than its peers, this formerly human body is laden "
"with thick crystal growths that pulsate as if alive.  Its hands are little "
"more than spiked clubs now, dragging behind it as it trudges along."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/wild_aliens/strays.json
msgid "stray titan"
msgid_plural "stray titans"
msgstr[0] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'stray titan'}
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/wild_aliens/strays.json
msgid ""
"This towering mass of fused flesh and stone crushes everything that stands "
"in its way with club-like 'hands'. Despite its great power, it seems only a "
"matter of time before the very shell that protects it crushes it beneath its"
" own weight."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/wild_aliens/strays.json
msgid "stray husk"
msgid_plural "stray husks"
msgstr[0] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'stray husk'}
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/wild_aliens/strays.json
msgid ""
"The war-torn and charred body of a human, still smoldering after exposure to"
" alien bioweapons.  Clusters of shimmering purple crystals sprout from its "
"wounds like weeds pushing out between cracks in concrete."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/wild_aliens/strays.json
msgid "stray waif"
msgid_plural "stray waifs"
msgstr[0] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'stray waif'}
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/wild_aliens/strays.json
msgid ""
"If not for the patches of irregular crystal growth, it would be easy to "
"mistake this little figure for a normal child.  Unfortunately, whatever "
"terrible weapon that the aliens used on much of the population has been no "
"kinder to them.  Still, the idea of putting them down still twists your gut "
"in a primal way."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/wild_aliens/strays.json
msgid "stray tinder"
msgid_plural "stray tinders"
msgstr[0] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'stray tinder'}
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/wild_aliens/strays.json
msgid ""
"A child, still smoking and wounded after firsthand exposure to alien "
"bioweapons.  Its features are just intact enough to make your gut churn."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/wild_aliens/strays.json
msgid "stray creep"
msgid_plural "stray creeps"
msgstr[0] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'stray creep'}
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/wild_aliens/strays.json
msgid ""
"A smouldering husk of a creature scrambling about on all fours, a mongrel "
"housepet or the like only recently mutated by exposure to alien bioweapons."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/wild_aliens/strays.json
msgid "stray wretch"
msgid_plural "stray wretches"
msgstr[0] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'stray wretch', 'str_pl': 'stray wretches'}
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/wild_aliens/strays.json
msgid ""
"This blur of jagged, crystal-fused limbs and hair might have been a housepet"
" at some point, but now it leaps and skitters around like something out of a"
" nightmare.  It is likely that one day the very crystal that arms it will "
"weigh overtake its body and weigh it to the ground, given its slow expansion"
" across its body."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/wild_aliens/strays.json
msgid "germinating crystal mass"
msgid_plural "germinating crystal masses"
msgstr[0] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'germinating crystal mass', 'str_pl':
#. 'germinating crystal masses'}
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/wild_aliens/strays.json
msgid ""
"A human-sized mound of shimmering blue-purple crystals growing on the base "
"of what looks like a mound of foul smelling garbage and organic leftovers.  "
"Long, thin tendrils appear to grow out of the mound, and are subtly rooting "
"down into the ground below it, boring through dirt and concrete alike.  It "
"crackles weakly with electrical energy.  If you look closely, it almost "
"looks like something wet and meaty is squirming just inside the inner shell "
"of crystals…"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/wild_aliens/strays.json
msgid "resonant crystal mass"
msgid_plural "resonant crystal masses"
msgstr[0] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'resonant crystal mass', 'str_pl': 'resonant
#. crystal masses'}
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/wild_aliens/strays.json
msgid ""
"A set of rail thin crystals growing haphazardly from a mound of rock and "
"composted organic matter, fastened in place by thick strands of bizzare "
"alien material.  The buzzing of natural energy playing among the tines seems"
" culminate into an almost musical sound.  While pleasant at a distance, this"
" can devolve to a deafening high pitched whine when it feels threatened."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/wild_aliens/strays.json
msgid "flailing crystal mass"
msgid_plural "flailing crystal masses"
msgstr[0] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'flailing crystal mass', 'str_pl': 'flailing
#. crystal masses'}
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/wild_aliens/strays.json
msgid ""
"A tall, singular crystal, growing out of a sizable pile of debris that has "
"sprouted a multitude of thin, whiplike tendrils that constantly snake around"
" it like feelers.  It frequently grabs nearby objects and drags them into "
"the pile beneath it, as if hoarding."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/wild_aliens/strays.json
msgid "energized crystal mass"
msgid_plural "energized crystal masses"
msgstr[0] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'energized crystal mass', 'str_pl': 'energized
#. crystal masses'}
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/wild_aliens/strays.json
msgid ""
"A crooked, fiercely glowing blue-purple crystal that visibly discharges "
"electricity into the surrounding environment without any particular intent."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/wild_aliens/strays.json
msgid "crystal mass wall"
msgid_plural "crystal mass walls"
msgstr[0] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'crystal mass wall'}
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/wild_aliens/strays.json
msgid ""
"A massive wall of thick, blocky crystals that glow faintly and crackle with "
"electric energy."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/wild_aliens/strays.json
msgid "crystal mass hive"
msgid_plural "crystal mass hives"
msgstr[0] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'crystal mass hive'}
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/wild_aliens/strays.json
msgid ""
"A towering mass of blue-purple crystal chunks coverd in small, fist-sized "
"holes, from which drips a disgusting, faintly glowing rock slurry - perhaps "
"a nutrient mix for its young.  After all, it seems to subtly pulsate, as if "
"more organic than its mineral appearance would suggest.  The air around it "
"perpetually crackles with palpable energy and menaces with a set of thick, "
"meaty tendrils with razor-like barbs, with something else just as unseemly "
"writhing just beneath the murky surface of the glassy 'rocks'."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/wild_aliens/strays.json
msgid "crystal mite"
msgid_plural "crystal mites"
msgstr[0] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'crystal mite'}
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/wild_aliens/strays.json
msgid ""
"A tiny, multilegged creature that appears to be made of a chunk of crystal."
"  It skitters around on wire-like legs, eating bits of organic leftovers to "
"gain mass in hopes of one day seeding a crystal colony of its own."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/wild_aliens/strays.json
msgid "engorged crystal mite"
msgid_plural "engorged crystal mites"
msgstr[0] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'engorged crystal mite'}
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/wild_aliens/strays.json
msgid ""
"A swollen crystal mite, now grown to about the size of a cat, heavy enough "
"with accumulated crystal structure to settle down and begin germinating into"
" a proper crystal mass."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/mutations/traits.json
msgid "RP: Combatant"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for RP: Combatant
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/mutations/traits.json
msgid ""
"You've seen your fair share of scruffs and scrapes, and when the Cataclysm "
"hit, you fought the Occupiers and managed to survive to tell the tale.  Has "
"no direct skill benefit, but allows you to present yourself as a fighter to "
"certain NPCs.  Some might even recognize you."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/mutations/traits.json
msgid "RP: Medic"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for RP: Medic
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/mutations/traits.json
msgid ""
"Your job or experiences had you seeing all sorts of trauma, both physical "
"and mental, and you were trusted during the Cataclysm to provide life-saving"
" care.  Has no direct skill benefit, but allows you to present yourself as a"
" healer to certain NPCs.  Some might even recognize you."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/mutations/traits.json
msgid "RP: Leader"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for RP: Leader
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/mutations/traits.json
msgid ""
"Whether or not you like it, you've always had a knack for managing people "
"and have some hard-won skill in doing so.  During the arrival and the "
"ensuing chaos, you helped lead people around you to safety.  Has no direct "
"skill benefit, but allows you to present yourself as a leader to certain "
"NPCs.  Some might even recognize you."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'C-4 hack'}
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/monsters.json
msgid ""
"An automated kamikaze drone, this small flying robot appears to have some "
"C-4 inside."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'flashbang hack'}
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/monsters.json
msgid ""
"An automated kamikaze drone, this small flying robot appears to have a "
"flashbang inside."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'tear gas hack'}
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/monsters.json
msgid ""
"An automated kamikaze drone, this small flying robot appears to have a tear "
"gas canister inside."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'grenade hack'}
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/monsters.json
msgid ""
"An automated kamikaze drone, this small flying robot appears to have a "
"grenade inside."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'manhack'}
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/monsters.json
msgid ""
"An automated anti-personnel drone, a small flying robot surrounded by "
"whirring blades."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for scenario 'Evacuee' for a male character.
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You have survived the initial wave of panic and managed to avoid being taken"
" to the Designated Living Zones.  You begin in the (relative) safety in one "
"of the many government evac shelters."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for scenario 'Evacuee' for a female character.
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You have survived the initial wave of panic and managed to avoid being taken"
" to the Designated Living Zones.  You begin in the (relative) safety in one "
"of the many government evac shelters."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for scenario 'Missed' for a male character.
#. ~ Description for scenario 'Large Building' for a male character.
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Whether due to stubbornness, ignorance, or just plain bad luck, you missed "
"the evacuation and managed to avoid being turned into one of those things "
"outside.  You are now left in a city full of the hateful revenants of your "
"neighbors."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for scenario 'Missed' for a female character.
#. ~ Description for scenario 'Large Building' for a female character.
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Whether due to stubbornness, ignorance, or just plain bad luck, you missed "
"the evacuation and managed to avoid being turned into one of those things "
"outside.  You are now left in a city full of the hateful revenants of your "
"neighbors."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for scenario 'Surrounded' for a male character.
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You've attracted the attention of a pack of mutants in some way, now they're"
" all around and you'll likely have to fight thorough them if you want to "
"escape."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for scenario 'Surrounded' for a female character.
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You've attracted the attention of a pack of mutants in some way, now they're"
" all around and you'll likely have to fight thorough them if you want to "
"escape."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for scenario 'Safe Place' for a male character.
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You've found some distant safe place that seems to have gone unnoticed by "
"the invasion force.  Looks like you're on your own…"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for scenario 'Safe Place' for a female character.
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You've found some distant safe place that seems to have gone unnoticed by "
"the invasion force.  Looks like you're on your own…"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for scenario 'Infected' for a male character.
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"In the chaos and panic of the invasion, you got a horrible wound!  You "
"didn't get proper medical care, and now it has started turning green."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for scenario 'Infected' for a female character.
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"In the chaos and panic of the invasion, you got a horrible wound!  You "
"didn't get proper medical care, and now it has started turning green."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for scenario 'Wilderness' for a male character.
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You find yourself amongst trees.  The screaming and the explosions are "
"fainter this far from civilization, but you'd better know what you're doing "
"out here."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for scenario 'Wilderness' for a female character.
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You find yourself amongst trees.  The screaming and the explosions are "
"fainter this far from civilization, but you'd better know what you're doing "
"out here."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for scenario 'Helicopter Crash' for a male character.
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"While being evacuated from a hot zone, the pilot lost control of the "
"helicopter and crashed in the middle of nowhere.  Hopefully some of the "
"soldiers that were with you also survived the accident."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for scenario 'Helicopter Crash' for a female character.
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"While being evacuated from a hot zone, the pilot lost control of the "
"helicopter and crashed in the middle of nowhere.  Hopefully some of the "
"soldiers that were with you also survived the accident."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/furniture_terrain/indoor_furniture.json
msgid "Edison generator"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for Edison generator
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/furniture_terrain/indoor_furniture.json
msgid ""
"This imposing apparatus harnesses 'atmospheric charges', or at least thats "
"what the news said when these things came out.  Pioneered by Elton Moosek "
"and his Bluebox team, these were immediately snapped up by the government "
"due to their potential to generate near limitless power.  It's not doing "
"much good here though.  Perhaps it could be salvaged for other purposes."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for dresser
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/furniture_terrain/indoor_furniture.json
msgid "Dress yourself!"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/furniture_terrain/outdoor-furniture.json
msgid "poppy bush"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for poppy bush
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/furniture_terrain/outdoor-furniture.json
msgid ""
"An invasive species brought to Earth by the invaders and found it quite to "
"its liking.  It spiny, writhing fronds make it look more like a jungle bush "
"than a conventional poppy except for its red petals, but is named after such"
" due to its similar medicinal properties.  It exudes a potent, sleep "
"inducing aroma."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'large quiver'}
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/items/armor.json
msgid ""
"A large leather quiver trimmed with metal, worn on the back, that can hold "
"60 arrows.  Historically used by horse archers, rather than foot archers, "
"but sometimes horses are a little hard to come by in this day and age.  "
"Activate to store arrows."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'bra'}
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/items/armor.json
msgid ""
"A simple bra.  For protecting those bits you don't want creatures to look "
"at."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': "children's book"}
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/items/books.json
msgid ""
"A little book for little readers.  The colorful cartoon characters and sweet"
" stories contained herein belong to a different time, before the sky grew "
"dark and the aliens arrived."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'TIME magazine'}
#. ~ Description for {'str': 'US Weekly', 'str_pl': 'US Weeklies'}
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/items/books.json
msgid ""
"Current events concerning a bunch of people who're all dead now - or working"
" for them."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Zombie Survival Guide', 'str_pl': 'copies of
#. Zombie Survival Guide'}
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/items/books.json
msgid ""
"While this seems like it would be at least partially useful in this "
"situation, the sheer amount of speculative fiction present makes it "
"practically useless.  What the hell is a mi-go?  Aren't triffids from some "
"ancient movie?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'cooked brains'}
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/items/carnivore.json
msgid ""
"Now you can emulate a zombie!  Preparing brain for eating is challenging, "
"and this doesn't seem to be the best way to do it."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/items/carnivore.json
msgid "chunk of alien meat"
msgid_plural "chunks of alien meat"
msgstr[0] "외계인 고기 덩어리"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'chunk of alien meat', 'str_pl': 'chunks of alien
#. meat'}
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/items/carnivore.json
msgid ""
"This dense, stringy substance smells strongly like burnt oil, or some sort "
"of industrial chemical.  For all intents and purposes, it seems like the "
"'meat' of the creature, but its bizarre texture and faintly red-purple tint "
"is unlike anything you've ever experienced before.  You could eat it, but no"
" doubt it would not only taste henious but also make you sick, being made of"
" material your body was never supposed to injest."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/items/carnivore.json
msgid "dehydrated alien meat"
msgid_plural "dehydrated alien meats"
msgstr[0] ""

#. ~ Description for dehydrated alien meat
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/items/carnivore.json
msgid ""
"Pieces of alien meat that have been dried to prevent them from rotting away."
"  It will still poison you if you eat this."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/items/carnivore.json
msgid "alien bone"
msgid_plural "alien bones"
msgstr[0] ""

#. ~ Description for alien bone
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/items/carnivore.json
msgid ""
"A piece of a hard material with many crests and protrusions, made of a hard "
"material that occasionally leaves a bit of moisture on your hand when you "
"touch it.  It seems basically like a bone, though not one you'd see in any "
"anatomy textbook.  You could eat it, but no doubt it would not only taste "
"henious but also make you sick, being made of material your body was never "
"supposed to injest.  It might at least be able to be used for something, if "
"not as well as the earthly variant due to its fiddly size and shape."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/items/carnivore.json
msgid "alien fat"
msgid_plural "alien fats"
msgstr[0] ""

#. ~ Description for alien fat
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/items/carnivore.json
msgid ""
"A chunk of dense fat that is tough and rubbery.  It smells simply henious, "
"like open sewer and pungent chemicals, and is doubtless full of strange "
"material that your body was never supposed to injest.  It might at least be "
"able to be used for something, if not quite as well as its earthly variant "
"due to its relative impurities."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/items/carnivore.json
msgid "alien tallow"
msgid_plural "alien tallows"
msgstr[0] ""

#. ~ Description for alien tallow
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/items/carnivore.json
msgid ""
"A smooth grayish block of cleaned and rendered alien fat.  Processing it "
"seems to have at least removed some of the smell.  It won't spoil for a very"
" long time, and can be used as an ingredient in many projects.  It is no "
"safer than its source material to consume."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/items/carnivore.json
msgid "chunk of unusual meat"
msgid_plural "chunks of unusual meat"
msgstr[0] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'chunk of unusual meat', 'str_pl': 'chunks of
#. unusual meat'}
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/items/carnivore.json
msgid ""
"Meat from the aliens is typically quite foul, full of toxins and substances "
"not meant to be digested by humans, however this piece almost looks edible -"
" if not for a few sections that still have strange hues and disgusting, "
"spongey texture.  Still, with a bit of preperation, it might even be "
"somewhat palatable."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/items/carnivore.json
msgid "scrap of unusual meat"
msgid_plural "scraps of unusual meat"
msgstr[0] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'scrap of unusual meat', 'str_pl': 'scraps of
#. unusual meat'}
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/items/carnivore.json
msgid ""
"A tiny scrap of meat from an unusual creature.  It smells a bit odd and has "
"a variety of discolorations that indicate that it is still going to be rough"
" on your digestive system.  Still, seems digestible at least, if you cook it"
" and remove the worst parts."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/items/carnivore.json
msgid "unusual humanoid meat"
msgid_plural "unusual humanoid meats"
msgstr[0] ""

#. ~ Description for unusual humanoid meat
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/items/carnivore.json
msgid ""
"Freshly butchered from the body of an alien creature that was unsettlingly "
"humanoid in appearance.  It smells faintly of chemicals and is colored odd "
"hues that indicate that it is still going to be rough on your digestive "
"system.  You'd have to be crazy or starving to eat this."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for cooked cretin
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/items/carnivore.json
msgid ""
"Cooked meat from an alien humanoid.  Now that the worst bits have been "
"processed, it's probably digestible, if not very appetizing."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/items/carnivore.json
msgid "cooked unusual meat"
msgid_plural "cooked unusual meats"
msgstr[0] ""

#. ~ Description for cooked unusual meat
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/items/carnivore.json
msgid ""
"This is a cooked chunk of meat from an unusual critter.  It has strange "
"colors, smells a bit funny, and has a mushy texture but it tastes… mostly "
"normal.  Hopefully you cut away the worst bits well enough."
msgstr ""
"이것은 갓 익힌 낯선 동물 고기 한 덩어리입니다. 색이 희한하고, 냄새가 좀 기묘하지만, 그외에는… 괜찮은 것 같습니다. 뭐, 먹다가 "
"이상한 부분은 도려내면 되겠죠."

#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/items/carnivore.json
msgid "cooked scrap of unusual meat"
msgid_plural "cooked scraps of unusual meat"
msgstr[0] ""

#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/items/carnivore.json
msgid "unusual tallow"
msgid_plural "unusual tallows"
msgstr[0] ""

#. ~ Description for unusual tallow
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/items/carnivore.json
msgid ""
"A smooth white block of cleaned and rendered fat sourced from an unusual "
"creature.  It will remain edible for a very long time, and can be used as an"
" ingredient in many foods and projects."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/items/carnivore.json
msgid "unusual lard"
msgid_plural "unusual lards"
msgstr[0] ""

#. ~ Description for unusual lard
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/items/carnivore.json
msgid ""
"A smooth white block of dry-rendered fat sourced from an alien.  It will "
"remain edible for a very long time, and can be used as an ingredient in many"
" foods and projects."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'chunk of mutant humanoid fat', 'str_pl': 'chunks
#. of mutant humanoid fat'}
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/items/carnivore.json
msgid "Freshly butchered fat from an alien humanoid."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/items/carnivore.json
msgid "unusual humanoid tallow"
msgid_plural "unusual humanoid tallows"
msgstr[0] ""

#. ~ Description for unusual humanoid tallow
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/items/carnivore.json
msgid ""
"A smooth white block of cleaned and rendered fat sourced from an alien "
"humanoid.  It won't rot for a very long time, and can be used as an "
"ingredient in many foods and projects."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/items/carnivore.json
msgid "unusual humanoid lard"
msgid_plural "unusual humanoid lards"
msgstr[0] ""

#. ~ Description for unusual humanoid lard
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/items/carnivore.json
msgid ""
"A smooth white block of dry-rendered fat sourced from an alien humanoid.  It"
" won't rot for a very long time, and can be used as an ingredient in many "
"foods and projects."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for raw human skin
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/items/carnivore.json
msgid ""
"A carefully folded raw skin harvested from a humanoid.  You can cure it for "
"storage and tanning, or eat it if you're desperate enough."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/items/carnivore.json
msgid "raw humanoid pelt"
msgid_plural "raw humanoid pelts"
msgstr[0] ""

#. ~ Description for raw humanoid pelt
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/items/carnivore.json
msgid ""
"A carefully folded raw skin harvested from a fur-bearing creature that was "
"disturbingly humanoid.  It still has the fur attached.  You can cure it for "
"storage and tanning, or eat it if you're desperate enough."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'smartphone'}
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/items/electronic.json
msgid ""
"A popular, fancy smartphone.  Capable of making photos due to integrated "
"camera and illuminating an area as per its flashlight app, assuming it has "
"enough charge.  The smartphone also has a clock app that includes an alarm."
"  Runs on a small, proprietary power cell that needs a specialized charger."
"  That is to say, is quite difficult to recharge post-Cataclysm."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'newspaper page'}
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/items/newspaper.json
msgid ""
"A single sheet of newspaper broadsheet.  Most of the information on there is"
" terribly trivial, or out of date, but one thing catches your eye briefly - "
"some things from before the Cataclysm, and some even after."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/items/ranged.json
msgid ""
"A six-foot wooden bow that takes a fair amount of strength to draw.  It can "
"be used effectively by those of somewhat above-average strength.  Used "
"mainly in medieval England in wartime, but pierces hide just as well as "
"chainmail."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/items/ranged.json
msgid ""
"This ancient firearm lacks the fire-rate of modern weapons, but packs as "
"much punch as the best of 'em and rewards the skilled shooter with easily-"
"crafted ammunition."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'electric carver (off)', 'str_pl': 'electric
#. carvers (off)'}
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/items/tools.json
msgid ""
"An electric meat carver powered by batteries.  Two serrated blades that "
"vibrate together to slice just about anything from turkey to ham… even your "
"enemies!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'noise emitter (off)', 'str_pl': 'noise emitters
#. (off)'}
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/items/tools.json
msgid ""
"This device was constructed by 'enhancing' a speaker ripped off from some "
"electronic device with some amplifier circuits.  It has now no other use "
"beside emitting loud crackling static noise, that could distract an enemy."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'noise emitter (on)', 'str_pl': 'noise emitters
#. (on)'}
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/items/tools.json
msgid ""
"This device has been turned on and is emitting horrible crackles, pops and "
"other static sounds.  Quick, get away from it before it draws enemies to "
"you!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'electronic handcuffs'}
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/items/tools.json
msgid ""
"A pair of electronic handcuffs, used by automated New Order units to detain captives.  Their continuous siren clearly identifies the wearer as a person of interet and alerts nearby 'safety teams' to their presence.  Wait for their arrival, don't try to escape or to remove the cuffs - they will administer an electric shock.\n"
"However, since capture is out of the question, you're probably in for a painful time, unless you get creative…"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'hedge trimmer (off)', 'str_pl': 'hedge trimmers
#. (off)'}
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/items/tools.json
msgid ""
"A cordless, double-sided, gasoline-powered hedge trimmer.  A long line of "
"sharp-edged teeth extends from the engine; turning the trimmer on will make "
"them rapidly vibrate.  The poor man's chainsaw as far as your enemies are "
"concerned."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'hedge trimmer (on)', 'str_pl': 'hedge trimmers
#. (on)'}
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/items/tools.json
msgid ""
"A cordless, double-sided, gasoline-powered hedge trimmer.  It is currently "
"on, ready to do some alien topiary; use this item to turn it off."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'circular saw (off)', 'str_pl': 'circular saws
#. (off)'}
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/items/tools.json
msgid ""
"A lightweight handheld cordless circular saw.  Spins a circular blade fast "
"enough to cut wood, aliens, or in an emergency, pizza.  The blade, while "
"effective in combat, is hard to hit with due to its small size."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'reinforced solar panel'}
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/items/vehicle.json
msgid ""
"A solar panel that has been covered with a pane of reinforced glass to "
"protect the delicate solar cells from aliens or errant baseballs.  The glass"
" causes this panel to produce slightly less power than a normal panel.  "
"Useful for a vehicle."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'upgraded reinforced solar panel'}
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/items/vehicle.json
msgid ""
"An upgraded solar panel that has been covered with a pane of reinforced "
"glass to protect the delicate solar cells from aliens or errant baseballs.  "
"The glass causes this panel to produce slightly less power than a normal "
"upgraded panel.  Useful for a vehicle."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'lobotomizer'}
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/items/weapons.json
msgid ""
"This is a hand-forged collapsible tool that has two axe heads and sharp "
"shovel-like tip on one end.  It can be used as a shovel, or you could chop "
"an enemy up with it instead."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'spike on a stick'}
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/items/weapons.json
msgid ""
"A flimsy pole made of wood with a basic metal spike tied to it.  It's barely"
" sharp, and crudely constructed, but it will keep an enemy out of arm's "
"reach until you can find something better."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/locations/evac_center.json
msgid "Firestation Base"
msgstr "소방서 캠프"

#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/locations/evac_center.json
msgid "Evac Shelter Base"
msgstr "대피소 캠프"

#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/fliers.json
msgid "This is an advertisement for a quality-of-life medicine."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/fliers.json
msgid "This is an advertisement promoting enlisting in the US armed forces."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/fliers.json
msgid ""
"This is a hand-drawn flier that has been photocopied for wide distribution."
"  It reads, in what looks like sharpie-bolded letters, \"THEY DON'T WANT YOU"
" TO KNOW.  They KNEW this would happen.  They were watching everything.  "
"They struck a deal even before they landed.\"  There used to be tear-away "
"phone numbers at the bottom, but they're all gone now."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/fliers.json
msgid ""
"This is a government-issued, air-dropped alert.  \"EVACUTE IMMEDIATELY.  "
"Proceed to your closest FEMA operated community shelter to await police and "
"military escort to safety.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/fliers.json
msgid ""
"This is a government-issued, air-dropped alert.  \"EVACUATE IMMEDIATELY.  "
"Police and military forces have been dispatched to your area and will help "
"escort you to safety.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/fliers.json
msgid ""
"This is a government-issued, air-dropped alert.  \"EVACUATION ALERT.  Please"
" make your way to the nearest FEMA evacuation shelter.    Seek protection "
"from police and military forces if traveling in groups.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/fliers.json
msgid ""
"This is a government-issued, air-dropped alert.  \"EVACUATION ALERT.  Please"
" make your way to the nearest FEMA evacuation shelter.  Travel in groups and"
" avoid crowds.  Avoid hostile forces at all costs.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/fliers.json
msgid ""
"This is a glossy, high quality flier.  \"What they don't want you to know!  "
"Reading this may save your life.\"  Inside is a series of warnings "
"recommending people avoid the evacuation shelters, state roads, and worse, "
"contact with any police or military forces as they might be rogue.  A "
"picture of uniformed humans apparently in league with the invaders is "
"included, as well as several shots of civilians being lead off a FEMA bus "
"and towards an alien spaceship."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/fliers.json
msgid ""
"This is a glossy advertisement from FEMA asking that people donate their "
"canned goods in return for tax writeoffs.  From the date on the flier, it "
"doesn't look like the initative ever had time to get off the ground."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/fliers.json
msgid ""
"This is an advertisement for a local electronics store, dated a few weeks "
"before the evacuation order.  \"Sale on smartphones and refurbished laptops "
"at DigiMart, three days only!\""
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/fliers.json
msgid ""
"This very recent looking air-dropped alert.  \"THE WAR IS OVER.  Do not "
"continue to fight.  Fugitives will be charged with malcompliant "
"destabilizaion if they do not surrender to their nearest safety office at "
"once.  Join our New Order.  Do not live in squalor.  Witness what we can do "
"*together*.\"  Pictured is one of the Designated Living Zones, a city and "
"its surrounding areas set aside specifically for humans.  Underneath is "
"listed some of the many qualities of the DLZs: safety, cleanliness, "
"opprotunity, and so on."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/fliers.json
msgid ""
"This very recent looking air-dropped alert.  \"THE WAR IS OVER.  Do not "
"continue to fight.  Surrender to your nearest surveillance drone for "
"immediate evacuation to a designated civilian zone.  Join our New Order.  "
"Witness what we can do *together*.\"  Pictured is the president, along with "
"several other 'smiling' world leaders, standing next to multiple cloaked "
"creatures."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/fliers.json
msgid ""
"This very recent looking air-dropped alert.  \"THE WAR IS OVER.  Resistance "
"will be met with lethal deterrence.  Do not throw away your potential.  Join"
" our New Order.  Witness what we can do *together*.\"  Pictured is a smiling"
" family of humans standing in front of an alien soldier."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/fliers.json
msgid ""
"This is a flier for pet food, with a cute animal performing a silly trick."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/fliers.json
msgid ""
"This is an advertisement for a portable generator, the kind that was "
"becoming popular in the face of increasing natural disasters before the end "
"of the world as you knew it."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/fliers.json
msgid ""
"This is very recent looking air-dropped alert.  \"HERE FOR YOU\" is written "
"in somewhat imposing text at the bottom of a depiction of several smiling "
"humans wearing Occupation uniforms."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/fliers.json
msgid ""
"This is very recent looking air-dropped alert.  \"HERE FOR YOU\" is written "
"in somewhat imposing text at the bottom of a depiction of several smiling "
"humans wearing Occupation uniforms.  Someone has scrawled \"TRAITORS\" in "
"marker across the front."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/fliers.json
msgid ""
"This is very recent looking air-dropped alert.  \"HERE FOR YOU\" is written "
"in somewhat imposing text at the bottom of a depiction of several smiling "
"humans wearing Occupation uniforms.  Someone has scrawled \"FAIR WEATHER "
"SOLDIERS\" across the front."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/fliers.json
msgid ""
"This is a public notice from a local police department encouraging citizens "
"to pack their supplies before their designated evacuation date to ensure "
"faster transit."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/fliers.json
msgid ""
"This is a public alert from the Federal Emergency Management Agency.  Its "
"message, repeated in several languages, reads: STAY IN YOUR HOMES!  All "
"residents of the New England Disaster Area are advised to shelter in place "
"wherever possible.  The United States Armed Forces are working to secure the"
" area.  If there is a nearby evacuation shelter you can get to safely, you "
"are recommended to do so.  Otherwise, stay in your homes until authorized "
"personnel evacuate you to a secured facility.  Thank you for your "
"compliance."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/fliers.json
msgid ""
"This is a public alert from the Federal Emergency Management Agency.  Its "
"message, repeated in several languages, consists of a list of towns serving "
"as major evacuation points from the hot zones.  Someone has scribbled off "
"most of the town names, and scrawled \"OVERRUN\" next to each one."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/fliers.json
msgid ""
"This is a public warning from an unnamed source.  Its rambling message, "
"poorly-photocopied onto both sides of the page, reads: Don't believe the "
"lies!  The Army cannot stop them, FEMA is in league with them.  They want us"
" alive but have no quams about killing anyone who RESISTS.  Secure supplies "
"and escape while there is still time."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/fliers.json
msgid ""
"This is a public warning from the Federal Government.  Its brief message, "
"repeated in several languages, reads:  The President of the United States "
"has declared unilateral martial law to be in effect in response to the "
"ongoing national crisis.  Continue to shelter in place until evacuated to an"
" appropriate emergency management camp by authorized military personnel.  A "
"24-hour curfew has been established.  This curfew will remain in effect "
"until further notice.  Stay indoors to avoid friendly fire."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/fliers.json
msgid ""
"This is an advertisement for Galaxybux coffee.  The smiling, feminine alien "
"mascot seems a little inappropriate now."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/fliers.json
msgid ""
"This is a public alert from the Federal Emergency Management Agency.  Its "
"message, repeated in several languages, consists of a list of towns serving "
"as major evacuation points from the hot zones."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/fliers.json
msgid ""
"This is a large movie poster for \"Action Packstone 6, Revenge of the "
"Catgirls\".  It shows a fit man in a leather jacket with a revolver and a "
