msgid ""
"kssht.  Dark Horse, this is Blue Jay, what's your status, over.  kssht.  "
"Blue Jay, this is Black Horse, still holding, but not for long.  kssht.  "
"Dark Horse, you've got to hold position for 3 hours.  We're almost black on "
