#. ~ Profession (male Rookie) description
#: data/mods/Fuji_Structures/starts/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"It's been months since the Cataclysm and somehow you're still greener than a"
" tree.  Maybe you're just a slow learner, who knows."
msgstr "대재앙이 닥친지 한달이 넘었지만, 당신은 새싹같이 새파란 초짜입니다. 뭐 누가 압니까 그냥 배우는게 조금 느린것 뿐일지."

#. ~ Profession (female Rookie) description
#: data/mods/Fuji_Structures/starts/professions.json
