msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Man-at-Arms"
msgstr "중기병"

#: data/mods/Medieval_Stuff/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Woman-at-Arms"
msgstr "중기병"

#. ~ Profession (male Man-at-Arms) description
#: data/mods/Medieval_Stuff/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"The medieval heavy cavalry of various countries in Europe, whether noble-"
"born or of common blood.  While knights traditionally were men-at-arms, not "
"every man-at-arms was a knight."
msgstr ""
"유럽 중세 시대 신분에 관계없이 다양한 국가에서 활약한 중장기병. 모든 기사들은 중기병에 속했지만, 모든 중기병이 기사인 것은 아닙니다."
" "

#. ~ Profession (female Woman-at-Arms) description
#: data/mods/Medieval_Stuff/professions.json
