msgid "aluminum foil wrap"
msgid_plural "aluminum foil wraps"
msgstr[0] "알루미늄 호일"

#. ~ Description for aluminum foil wrap
#: data/mods/More_Survival_Tools/items.json
msgid "A half crumpled sheet of aluminum foil, used for cooking and baking."
msgstr "반쯤 구겨진 알루미늄 호일. 요리나 제빵에 사용할 수 있다."

#: data/mods/More_Survival_Tools/items.json
msgid "makeshift crossbow"
msgid_plural "makeshift crossbows"
msgstr[0] "간이 쇠뇌"

#: data/mods/More_Survival_Tools/items.json
msgid ""
"A simple, handmade crossbow of the Skane style, with a wooden peg that is "
"pushed up from underneath to loose the bowstring.  Not as powerful as other "
"crossbow designs, but it is easier to draw the bow back.  Bolts fired from "
"this weapon have a good chance of remaining intact for re-use."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/More_Survival_Tools/items.json
msgid "heavy snare kit"
msgid_plural "heavy snare kits"
msgstr[0] "굵은 올가미"

#. ~ Use action done_message for heavy snare kit.
#. ~ Use action done_message for light snare kit.
#: data/mods/More_Survival_Tools/items.json
msgid "You set the snare trap."
msgstr "올가미 덫을 설치했다."

#. ~ Description for heavy snare kit
#: data/mods/More_Survival_Tools/items.json
msgid ""
"This is a kit for a simple trap consisting of a rope noose and a snare "
"trigger.  It requires a tree nearby.  It is effective at trapping monsters."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/More_Survival_Tools/items.json
msgid "light snare kit"
msgid_plural "light snare kits"
msgstr[0] "가는 올가미"

#. ~ Description for light snare kit
#: data/mods/More_Survival_Tools/items.json
msgid ""
"This is a kit for a simple trap consisting of a string noose and a snare "
"trigger.  It requires a young tree nearby.  It is effective at trapping and "
"killing some small animals."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/More_Survival_Tools/items.json
msgid "snare trigger"
msgid_plural "snare triggers"
msgstr[0] "올가미 고정대"

#. ~ Description for snare trigger
#: data/mods/More_Survival_Tools/items.json
msgid ""
"This is a stick that has been cut into a trigger mechanism for a snare trap."
msgstr "올가미 덫에 사용하기 위해 손질한 막대기."

#: data/mods/More_Survival_Tools/modinfo.json
msgid "More Survival Tools"
msgstr "더 많은 서바이벌 도구"

#. ~ Description for More Survival Tools
#: data/mods/More_Survival_Tools/modinfo.json
msgid ""
"For those who prefer being innawoods.  Adds several tools, various recipes "
"additions/tweaks, plus two new professions."
msgstr "야생 생활을 즐기는 사람에게 권장합니다. 몇몇 도구 추가, 다양한 조합법 추가/수정, 두 가지 새로운 직업 추가."

#: data/mods/More_Survival_Tools/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Wanderer"
msgstr "방랑자"

#: data/mods/More_Survival_Tools/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Wanderer"
msgstr "방랑자"

#. ~ Profession (male Wanderer) description
#: data/mods/More_Survival_Tools/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You always preferred the comfort of the open sky, far from the complexities "
"of modern life.  Though from the looks of it, things have changed since last"
" time you've been anywhere near civilization."
msgstr ""
"당신은 언제나 현대적인 삶의 복잡함보다 열린 하늘이 주는 편안함을 좋아했습니다. 보아하니 당신이 지난번 문명사회를 방문한 이후로 무언가 "
"일이 터진 것 같습니다."

#. ~ Profession (female Wanderer) description
#: data/mods/More_Survival_Tools/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You always preferred the comfort of the open sky, far from the complexities "
"of modern life.  Though from the looks of it, things have changed since last"
" time you've been anywhere near civilization."
msgstr ""
"당신은 언제나 현대적인 삶의 복잡함보다 열린 하늘이 주는 편안함을 좋아했습니다. 보아하니 당신이 지난번 문명사회를 방문한 이후로 무언가 "
"일이 터진 것 같습니다."

#: data/mods/More_Survival_Tools/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Prehistoric Hunter"
msgstr "선사시대 사냥꾼"

#: data/mods/More_Survival_Tools/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Prehistoric Hunter"
msgstr "선사시대 사냥꾼"

#. ~ Profession (male Prehistoric Hunter) description
#: data/mods/More_Survival_Tools/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"An out-of-place living relic of prehistory, stranded in an unfamiliar and "
"terrifying world.  Life as a hunter-gatherer was hard, but at least you "
"didn't have to fight the living dead, and you had your kin to stand beside "
"you.  Here, you're on your own."
msgstr ""
"당신은 선사시대에서 날려져온 살아있는 유물이며, 낯설고 무서운 세상에 떨어졌습니다. 수렵채집자 생활은 힘들었지만, 최소한 살아있는 시체와"
" 싸울 일은 없었고, 혈족들과 늘 함께였습니다. 그런데 지금은, 당신만 홀로 남겨졌군요."

#. ~ Profession (female Prehistoric Hunter) description
#: data/mods/More_Survival_Tools/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"An out-of-place living relic of prehistory, stranded in an unfamiliar and "
"terrifying world.  Life as a hunter-gatherer was hard, but at least you "
"didn't have to fight the living dead, and you had your kin to stand beside "
"you.  Here, you're on your own."
msgstr ""
"당신은 선사시대에서 날려져온 살아있는 유물이며, 낯설고 무서운 세상에 떨어졌습니다. 수렵채집자 생활은 힘들었지만, 최소한 살아있는 시체와"
" 싸울 일은 없었고, 혈족들과 늘 함께였습니다. 그런데 지금은, 당신만 홀로 남겨졌군요."

#: data/mods/More_Survival_Tools/snippets.json
msgid ""
"\"Shoot elfy mutants.  Carve more bolts outta their bones.  Rinse and "
"repeat.\""
msgstr "\"요정 돌연변이들을 쏴버려. 놈들의 뼈로 더 많은 볼트를 깎아. 헹궈내고 반복해.\""

#: data/mods/More_Survival_Tools/traps.json
msgid "light snare trap"
msgstr "가는 올가미 덫"

#: data/mods/More_Survival_Tools/traps.json
msgid "heavy snare trap"
msgstr "굵은 올가미 덫"

#: data/mods/Mundane_Zombies/modinfo.json
msgid "Mundane Zombies"
msgstr "평범한 좀비들"

#. ~ Description for Mundane Zombies
#: data/mods/Mundane_Zombies/modinfo.json
msgid "Removes all special zombies from the game."
msgstr "게임에서 모든 특수 좀비를 제거합니다."

#: data/mods/Mutant_NPCs/modinfo.json
msgid "Mutant NPCs"
msgstr "돌연변이 NPC"

#. ~ Description for Mutant NPCs
#: data/mods/Mutant_NPCs/modinfo.json
msgid ""
"NPCs wandering the wasteland will occasionally have mutations --- your foes "
"included.  Beware!"
msgstr "황무지를 돌아다니는 NPC들이 종종 변이를 가지고 있습니다 --- 당신의 적들도 마찬가지죠.  조심하세요!"

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/modinfo.json
msgid "My Sweet Cataclysm"
msgstr "마이 스위트 카타클리즘"

#. ~ Description for My Sweet Cataclysm
#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/modinfo.json
msgid ""
"In the wake of the Cataclysm sweets and snacks are coming to life.  You "
"could be one of them and walk through the Cataclysm as a human shaped piece "
"of sugar with your pet necco wafer, or you could just hunt them for some "
"sweet treats."
msgstr ""
"대재앙이 시작되며 달콤한 간식들이 살아 움직이기 시작했습니다. 저들과 하나되면 네코 웨이퍼를 애완동물로 데리고 다니는 인간형 설탕 "
"덩어리가 될 수 있고, 달달한게 먹고 싶다면 놈들을 사냥할 수도 있습니다."

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_comestibles.json
msgid "necco corpse"
msgid_plural "necco corpses"
msgstr[0] "네코 시체"

#. ~ Description for necco corpse
#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_comestibles.json
msgid ""
"The corpse of a necco, now it really looks like a giant necco wafer.  Surely"
" a bite wouldn't hurt, right?"
msgstr "이제는 그냥 커다란 네코 웨이퍼처럼 보이는 네코 시체입니다. 한 입 맛본다고 해서 문제가 생길 것 같지는 않습니다. 그렇죠?"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'marshmallows'}
#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_comestibles.json
msgid ""
"A handful of squishy, fluffy, puffy, delicious marshmallows.  They feel "
"oddly warm…"
msgstr "말랑말랑하고, 폭신해보이며, 뭉실뭉실한 맛있는 마시멜로 한 움큼. 이상하게 따뜻하다..."

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': "s'mores"}
#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_comestibles.json
msgid ""
"A pair of graham crackers with some chocolate and a marshmallow between "
"them.  Warms radiates from it, as if it was… alive?"
msgstr ""
"통밀 사각형 크래커 두 쪽 사이에 초콜릿과 마시멜로가 들어가있다. 따뜻한 온기가 새어나온다. 마치... 살아있던... 것처럼?"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'chewy candy', 'str_pl': 'chewy candies'}
#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_comestibles.json
msgid ""
"A handful of colorful fruit-flavored chewy candy.  They're warm to the touch"
" and you can feel a slow beat coming from them.  How odd…"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for graham cracker
#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_comestibles.json
msgid ""
"Dry and sugary, these crackers will leave you thirsty, but go good with some"
" chocolate and marshmallows.  They shiver under your touch.  Weird!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for cookie
#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_comestibles.json
msgid ""
"Sweet and delicious cookies, just like grandma used to bake.  They shiver "
"under your touch.  Weird!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for chewing gum
#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_comestibles.json
msgid ""
"Bright pink chewing gum.  Sugary, sweet, and bad for your teeth.  It's oddly"
" warm to the touch…"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for caffeinated chewing gum
#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_comestibles.json
msgid ""
"Chewing gum with added caffeine.  Sugary and bad for your teeth, but it's a "
"nice pick-me-up.  It's oddly warm to the touch…"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_effect.json
msgid "Gummed"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_effect.json
msgid "You have some gum on you."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_effect.json
msgid "You are covered in gum!"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_effect.json
msgid "You're trapped in gum!"
