#: data/mods/No_Lift_Requirements/modinfo.json
msgid "No Lifting Reqs"
msgstr "들어올리기 제한 해제"

#. ~ Description for No Lifting Reqs
#: data/mods/No_Lift_Requirements/modinfo.json
msgid ""
"Strength checks and lifting qualities are no longer required for installing "
"or removing vehicle parts."
msgstr "차량 부품의 제거나 설치 시에 요구하던 체력이나 들어올리기 제한이 해제됩니다."

#: data/mods/No_Medieval_Items/modinfo.json
msgid "No Medieval Items"
msgstr "중세 물품 제거"

#. ~ Description for No Medieval Items
#: data/mods/No_Medieval_Items/modinfo.json
msgid "Removes medieval weapons, armors, and specific books."
msgstr "중세풍 무기, 갑옷, 책 등을 제거합니다."

#: data/mods/No_Mutagen/modinfo.json
msgid "Disable Mutagens"
msgstr "뮤타젠 제거"

#. ~ Description for Disable Mutagens
#: data/mods/No_Mutagen/modinfo.json
msgid "Removes mutagen items from the game."
msgstr "게임에서 뮤타젠을 제거합니다."

#: data/mods/No_NPC_Food/modinfo.json
msgid "Disable NPC Needs"
msgstr "NPC 욕구 제거"

#. ~ Description for Disable NPC Needs
#: data/mods/No_NPC_Food/modinfo.json
msgid "Makes NPCs not require food, water or rest."
msgstr "NPC가 음식이나, 물 또는 수면을 요구하지 않습니다."

#: data/mods/No_Old_guns/modinfo.json
msgid "No Antique Firearms"
msgstr "구식 화기 제거"

#. ~ Description for No Antique Firearms
#: data/mods/No_Old_guns/modinfo.json
msgid "Removes all black powder and pre-Cold War firearms."
msgstr "모든 흑색화약, 냉전 전 무기를 삭제합니다."

#: data/mods/No_Rail_Stations/modinfo.json
msgid "No Rail Stations"
msgstr "철도역 금지"

#. ~ Description for No Rail Stations
#: data/mods/No_Rail_Stations/modinfo.json
msgid "Removes above-ground rail stations from the game."
msgstr "게임에서 지상 철도역을 제거합니다."

#: data/mods/No_Religious_Books/modinfo.json
msgid "Disable Religious Texts"
msgstr "종교 서적 제거"

#. ~ Description for Disable Religious Texts
#: data/mods/No_Religious_Books/modinfo.json
msgid "Removes religious text items from the game."
msgstr "게임에서 종교 경전을 제거합니다."

#: data/mods/No_Reviving/modinfo.json
msgid "Prevent Zombie Revivication"
msgstr "좀비 부활 방지"

#. ~ Description for Prevent Zombie Revivication
#: data/mods/No_Reviving/modinfo.json
msgid "Disables zombie revival."
msgstr "좀비가 부활하지 않습니다."

#: data/mods/No_Rivtech_Guns/modinfo.json
msgid "No Fictional Guns"
msgstr "가상 총기 제거"

#. ~ Description for No Fictional Guns
#: data/mods/No_Rivtech_Guns/modinfo.json
msgid "Removes fictional conventional firearms and ammunition."
msgstr "재래식 가상 화기와 탄약을 제거합니다."

#: data/mods/No_Survivor_Armor/modinfo.json
msgid "No Survivor Armor"
msgstr "생존용 방어구 제거"

#. ~ Description for No Survivor Armor
#: data/mods/No_Survivor_Armor/modinfo.json
msgid "Removes survivor armor."
msgstr "생존용 방어구를 제거합니다."

#: data/mods/Old_Mutations/modinfo.json
msgid "Old Mutations"
msgstr "예전 돌연변이"

#. ~ Description for Old Mutations
#: data/mods/Old_Mutations/modinfo.json
msgid ""
"Makes mutations work like before, without balancing changes and mutagen "
"accumulation."
msgstr "변화 및 돌연변이 축적을 균형 있게 조정하지 않고 이전과 같이 작동하도록 합니다."

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Robust Genetics'}
#: data/mods/Old_Mutations/modinfo.json
msgid ""
"You have a very strong genetic base.  If you mutate, the odds that the "
"mutation will be beneficial are greatly increased."
msgstr "당신은 아주 강력한 유전자를 가지고 있습니다. 돌연변이가 일어날 때, 좋은 변이가 일어날 확률이 크게 증가하게 됩니다."

#: data/mods/Only_Wildlife/modinfo.json
msgid "No Monsters"
msgstr "괴물 제거"

#. ~ Description for No Monsters
#: data/mods/Only_Wildlife/modinfo.json
msgid ""
"Removes all monsters from the game, save for those in the WILDLIFE category."
msgstr "게임에서 야생동물을 제외한 모든 괴물을 제거합니다."

#: data/mods/RL_Classes/classes.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Fighter"
msgstr "전사"

#: data/mods/RL_Classes/classes.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Fighter"
msgstr "전사"

#. ~ Profession (male Fighter) description
#: data/mods/RL_Classes/classes.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"A master of arms and armor and a fearsome martial combatant; you are a "
"fighter, forged in warfare and tempered on the battlefield."
msgstr "각종 병장기와 갑주의 운용에 능통하며, 위협적인 무술의 달인으로서 당신은 전투와 전쟁을 통해 단련된 전사입니다."

#. ~ Profession (female Fighter) description
#: data/mods/RL_Classes/classes.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"A master of arms and armor and a fearsome martial combatant; you are a "
"fighter, forged in warfare and tempered on the battlefield."
msgstr "각종 병장기와 갑주의 운용에 능통하며, 위협적인 무술의 달인으로서 당신은 전투와 전쟁을 통해 단련된 전사입니다."

#: data/mods/RL_Classes/classes.json
