msgstr "즐겨찾기된 %s(을)를 정말 먹을건가요?"

#: src/consumption.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "You digest your %s, but fail to acquire energy from it."
msgstr "%s을(를) 녹였지만, 전력을 얻지 못했다."

#: src/consumption.cpp
#, c-format
msgid ""
"<npcname> digests their %s for energy, but fails to acquire energy from it."
msgstr "<npcname>이(가) %s을(를) 녹였지만, 전력을 얻지 못했다."

#: src/consumption.cpp
#, c-format
msgid ""
"You digest your %s, but you're fully powered already, so the energy is "
"wasted."
msgstr "%s을(를) 녹였지만, 완전히 충전되어있어서 잉여전력이 낭비되었다."

#: src/consumption.cpp
#, c-format
msgid ""
"<npcname> digests a %s for energy, they're fully powered already, so the "
"energy is wasted."
msgstr "<npcname>이(가) %s을(를) 녹였지만, 완전히 충전되어있어서 잉여전력이 낭비되었다."

